<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/13548>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“I have realized how much of a shithole organization Turning Point USA is, and am glad I got out of this bullshit before I invested my whole life into it, let alone just my senior year of college. Now that I have a clear conscience and have no desire to continue my employment with Turning Point, I will have the time to find a real job, something I recommend for you. Maybe answering to business professionals rather than college dropouts, egotistic enough to put their face on stupid memes, will give you the leadership skills you desperately need for your positions.”&nbsp;";
        schema:archivedAt        <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/13548/source/>;
