<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/13517>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“…today, we are told that all of science is agreed on global warming. We hear it IS happening and it IS our fault. No argument is allowed. History has taught us that this is ­dangerous. A hundred years ago, someone came up with a new idea called eugenics.”";
