<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/13491>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“It started July 9, when ‘FOX &amp; Friends’ asked me if I’d come on the show the morning of July 10 to explain what ‘green jobs’ are. It meant an early morning the next day, but I was glad to do it, because exposing the green jobs scam is critical to fight cap-and-trade, my top legislative priority for the year. The producer asked me if I knew anything about green jobs ‘czar’ Van Jones. I didn’t but said I would find out.”";
