<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/13488>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“The Clean Power Grab similarly seeks to lock itself in permanently, even if eventually found illegal, by coercing states to do most of the dirty work of enacting draconian caps on fossil fuel use into state law,” Kerpen claimed in the article at ";
