        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "This is just the beginning of our mission to be more sustainable and responsible in our field. The more we know about the effects and impact we have in the world as marketers, the more we can make more conscious efforts in creating a more sustainable planet. #ClimateConfusion #SustainablyGrey";
