        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "By applying our creativity we help organizations lead the sustainability revolution. And our efforts are guided by the UN sustainable development goals so we can make marketing more purposeful. Using it as a tool to influence culture and build sustainable behaviors.";
