<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/13315>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“The takers outvoted the producers. In response to this, I have turned to my Bible and in II Peter, Chapter 1, verses 4-9 it says, ‘To faith we are to add goodness; to goodness, knowledge; to knowledge, self control; to self control, perseverance; to perseverance, godliness; to godliness, kindness; to brotherly kindness, love.’";
