<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/13270>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“Over the past decade, Canadians have been presented with numerous misrepresentations and a litany of misinformation regarding Canada’s oil and natural gas sector – and it has had negative impacts. Many Canadian’s do not realize Canada is an environmental leader in global oil and natural gas production, how pipelines are the safest and most responsible way to transport oil products, or how the Canadian oil and natural gas industry is the single largest investor in green technologies. This needs to change.”";
        schema:archivedAt        <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/13270/source/43>;
