        rdf:type         schema:CreativeWork;
        schema:citation  "Mitchell Beer. “<a href=\"https://www.theenergymix.com/2021/09/28/exclusive-no-mention-of-workers-as-fossil-lobby-aims-to-refocus-just-transition-on-producers/\" data-wpel-link=\"external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"external noopener noreferrer\">EXCLUSIVE: ‘No Mention of Workers’ as Fossil Lobby Aims to Refocus Just Transition on Producers</a>,” <em>The Energy Mix</em>. September 28, 2021. <a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20211005003742/https://www.theenergymix.com/2021/09/28/exclusive-no-mention-of-workers-as-fossil-lobby-aims-to-refocus-just-transition-on-producers/\" data-wpel-link=\"external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"external noopener noreferrer\">Archived October 4, 2021</a>. Archive URL: <a href=\"https://archive.ph/V2nly\" data-wpel-link=\"external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"external noopener noreferrer\">https://archive.ph/V2nly</a>"^^rdf:HTML .

<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/13263>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“I think they see just transition as a threat because it’s a way to bring oil workers and oil-dependent communities into the transition in a way that doesn’t create a loss for them,” he added. “If you’re an oil worker and you see climate action as a threat to your job, you’re not going to support it. If you see that the rest of the country is going to support you and your community through the transition in the same way we supported each other through COVID, you’ll be interested in the opportunities.”";
        schema:archivedAt        <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/13263/source/20>;
        schema:author            <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/entity/canadian-association-petroleum-producers-capp/>;
