        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“And in fact, most of the agenda of the Obama administration had very little to do with improving the environment,” Ebell added.&nbsp;“It had to do with an ideological agenda which he tried to, you know, institutionalize through executive order and regulation and President Trump is going to sweep that away and get down to the basic core values and mission of the ";
