<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/13211>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“Remember, President Trump said during the campaign more than once that he hoped to abolish the agency, he’d like to abolish it. Well, 31% is a good start isn’t it, first year […] it’s going to be a huge fight in congress to get programs eliminated. We can debate the details, but I think what we shouldn’t debate is we need a huge cut at the ";
        schema:archivedAt        <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/13211/source/103>;
        schema:author            <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/entity/myron-ebell/>;
