        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“We, at the Competitive Enterprise Institute, think it’s important to nip in the bud the assertion that Harvey and Irma are ominous signs of global warming; and since we’re not involved in hurricane relief, we will not be wasting time that should be spent on more important&nbsp;matters.”";
