<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/13132>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“Its ten pages of text are filled with gems of junk science, which are summed up in this ridiculous pontification: ‘Long-term changes in climate will produce more extreme weather events and put greater stress on critical Earth systems like oceans, freshwater, and biodiversity. These in turn will almost certainly have significant effects, both direct and indirect, across social, economic, political, and security realms during the next 20&nbsp;years.’”";
        schema:archivedAt        <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/13132/source/35>;
