<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/13092>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“These propagandists [Stephen Schneider and other scientists involved in ‘Climategate’] are not to be confused with the majority of scientists who have no political agenda and who simply want to be scientists. These are often the scientists who are under attack and should not be. Among them are Richard Lindzen, MIT, ";
