<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/13081>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "Schnare believes that the IPCC’s science “could be wrong. But it could also be right. And, what if the IPCC predictions are true? Then, as the first truth states, it’s too late, and the climate scientific community has admitted as much.”";
