<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/12936>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“There’s a lot of skepticism about global warming. One: Climate change. Is it happening? And most people say ‘yes, this is happening’, but how is it happening? You saw perhaps a new study that just came out predicting global cooling over the next 10 years based on ocean currents.”&nbsp;[…]";
        schema:archivedAt        <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/12936/source/>;
        schema:author            <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/entity/acton-institute/>;
