        schema:citation  ""^^rdf:HTML .

<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/12862>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "[00:05:46] Over time, it gradually struck me that there was really no amount of technological innovation that was going to make the sun shine more regularly or wind blow more reliably. In fact, nothing.&nbsp;[00:05:59][12.8]";
        schema:archivedAt        <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/12862/source/>;
