<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/12804>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "Our mission is to articulate that agenda and to embolden people who love technology and know that it can only flourish in a free economy. Ultimately, we want to convince policymakers that the tech industry’s future success rests on the same foundation that’s been essential to its brilliant history. Tech companies need an environment where the creators of new products are free to grow and innovate.“";
        schema:archivedAt        <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/12804/source/7>;
        schema:author            <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/entity/tech-central-station/>;
