<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/12645>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“No way will we ever see this on @BBCNews or @SkyNews – 1200 experts sign ‘There is no climate emergency’ declaration. Bloody well done Julia @JuliaHB1 with Andrew Montford on @TalkTV with @NetZeroWatch telling the truth not the usual emotive claptrap”.";
