<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/12592>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“Pruitt’s opponents painted him as a climate denier, despite the fact he’s never actually denied the science behind man-made warming. The reality is climatologists have a wide range of theories as to the magnitude of warming, the causes, man-made emissions’ impact on warming, and the rate of future warming and reliability of climate models to predict centuries into the future.";
