<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/12534>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“I don’t like to claim that I am an expert on anything, but I have enough knowledge about climate science and climate system to be able to write scientific papers and go to meetings and talk about monsoon systems and talk about any other things that you want to discuss about climate science issues. I’m as qualified as anybody that you know on this planet on this topic.”";
