        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“In 2004, David Legates and I realized there’s something seriously wrong with Michael Mann’s Work, another aspect of it, which is the instrumental temperature record, how he smoothed the data. […] The sweetest thing about this climate gate is that there is proof that Michael Mann did that.”";
