<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/12504>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“You know, it has been said by some that you are right on the extreme fringe. Well, hey, somebody occasionally has to stand out a little bit from the crowd to try and warn crowd of what’s about to hit them. And there is no doubt now that the governing class worldwide is increasingly tying itself together, using the excuses such as climate change, Agenda 21, environment, using gun control as something we can all unite behind. This is the kind of slogan you hear.”";
        schema:archivedAt        <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/12504/source/>;
        schema:author            <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/entity/alex-jones/>;
