<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/12503>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“They are trying to close Australia down,” Monckton claimed. “And the background to this, Alex, is Agenda 21, this UN program, all 14 chapters of it, which was first produced in nineteen ninety two at that ridiculous Rio Earth Summit. And the idea of Agenda 21 is to close down the economies of the West by saying that in the name of the environment, we must reduce the population of the Earth by nine tenths and we must do that, according to Bill Gates, by vaccination.”";
        schema:archivedAt        <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/12503/source/>;
        schema:author            <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/entity/alex-jones/>;
