        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "”[…] Bottom line: we have an authoritarian movement on the so-called left that is seeking to not just tax every form of human activity, and track it, but to also silence anyone that would dare challenge it. These people are not liberals. They are out-of-control authoritarians.”";
