<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/12475>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“BBB aims for a society in which we limit our impact on the climate where we actually are able to and for as much as we can influence it. […] Globally, the Netherlands only contribute 0.4% to CO₂ emissions and our CO₂ footprint per inhabitant is already much lower than that of many other (Western) countries.”";
        schema:archivedAt        <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/12475/source/>;
