<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/12421>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“International climate talks in Bonn last weekend were trying to salvage December’s failed Copenhagen summit. But some rich countries are imposing their own carbon limits anyway, and threatening to curb imports from poor countries that are not. We believe this will cripple the rich economies and harm the poor countries without doing much about&nbsp;emissions.”";
        schema:archivedAt        <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/12421/source/>;
