        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "Huffman: “Mr. Jorjani, I need… I’ve got a bunch of questions here. Let’s just do the yes or no and let’s keep it moving on. Is the answer yes? I mean, presumably… you’re the solicitor. You’re going to see these documents, aren’t you?";
