        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“Mr. Jorjani, I know you are an astute and scholarly lawyer. I know you appreciate that words matter. And if you have been mis-reading or mis-applying the Trump ethics pledge, as it pertains to Mr. Pendley, I have to wonder if you’ve not either been misreading or misapplying it as it pertains to Mr. Bernhardt.";
