        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“The eradication of these environmental policies, meanwhile, was helmed by a little-known but high-powered lawyer inside the Department of the Interior named Daniel Jorjani. Jorjani is the department’s principal deputy solicitor, and his signature adorned both orders when they were publicly released in Washington, D.C., last month,” ";
