<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/12323>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“The clear objective of the anti-smoking groups is economic rent, that is, the ability to obtain revenue and political power from the smoking issue,” Zycher wrote in a";
