<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/12262>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“The global-warming crusaders—who are fundamentally anti-capitalism anti-globalization, and sometimes anti-human rather than genuine environmentalists—have been very successful in shaping the rhetoric of the global-warming debate as a question of science vs. the anti-scientific, the ignorant, etc. But the most important questions in the debate are not scientific questions at all.”";
