<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/12246>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“[W]hat does the global-warming gang want? There isn’t any mystery about that. You can ask them. They want political power. They want the power to reorder economic and social life along the lines they see fit, rewarding their friends and punishing their enemies, and they want to enjoy the ultimate pleasure that they can imagine — self-righteousness — while they are doing it.";
        schema:archivedAt        <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/12246/source/13>;
        schema:author            <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/entity/kevin-d-williamson/>;
