        schema:abstract          "That’s the way you need to do it, not by some scientist somewhere saying, “Here is what we think is happening out there.” The fact of the matter is, the science is not settled on whether or not the climate change is being impacted by man to the point where we’re going to put America’s economics in jeopardy.”";
        schema:archivedAt        <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/12222/source/41>;
        schema:author            <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/entity/rick-perry/>;
