<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/12220>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "But the fact is, to put America’s economic future in jeopardy, asking us to cut back in areas that would have monstrous economic impact on this country is not good economics and I will suggest to you is not necessarily good science. Find out what the science truly is before you start putting the American economy in jeopardy.”";
