        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "The Keystone XL Pipeline has been stalled by President Obama for over four years, costing Americans jobs and greater energy security. The jobs and revenue to be generated from the construction and operation of the Keystone XL pipeline would not only help the First District of Kansas, but all of America. Advancing America’s energy production would go a long way to getting our economy back on track – and protecting our national security.”";
