        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“The inability of current climate models to explain the lack of warming over the past 15 years, plus predictions that the sun may be entering a prolonged period of low activity, suggest that much more analysis must be done before we impoverish ourselves by choking off economic&nbsp;growth.";
