        schema:citation  "“<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vkmDu_H1aAo\" data-wpel-link=\"external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"external noopener noreferrer\">SFi022 – Global warming is a SCAM w/ Prof Ian Plimer</a>,” YouTube video uploaded by user StopFundingIsrael. Archived video on file at Desmog."^^rdf:HTML .

