<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/12013>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“Climate fraudsters say that glaciers melting is an ‘early sign of global warming.’ They are lying. Glaciers have been melting for a very long time, and were melting during NASA’s claimed coldest years ever.”";
