        schema:citation  "“<a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20210824175358/https://www.rebelnews.com/rebel_news_presents_dr_patrick_moores_deplatformed_speech_in_regina\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener external\" data-wpel-link=\"external\">Rebel News presents: Dr. Patrick Moore’s de-platformed speech in Regina</a>,”&nbsp;<em>Rebel News</em>, August 12, 2021. Archived .mp4 on file at DeSmog."^^rdf:HTML .

