        schema:citation  "Darren Samuelsohn. “<a href=\"http://web.archive.org/web/20160524235048/http://www.politico.com/agenda/story/2015/07/inside-the-fight-against-obamas-climate-plan-000134\" data-wpel-link=\"external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"external noopener noreferrer\">Inside the fight against Obama’s climate plan</a>,”<em> Politico</em>, July 7, 2015. Archived May 24, 2016. WebCite URL: <a href=\"http://www.webcitation.org/6hkteJ48L\" data-wpel-link=\"external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"external noopener noreferrer\">http://www.webcitation.org/6hkteJ48L</a>"^^rdf:HTML .

<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/11817>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "[…] I’ve spent the last 25 years working on Clean Air Act issues and I can say with some confidence that the act doesn’t work very well, if the goal is to get a level of environmental protection at the lowest possible cost. We’re paying a lot more than we need to for the reductions that we’re getting because there’s so much underbrush here. People are starting to talk about another round of Clean Air Act reauthorization.”";
        schema:archivedAt        <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/11817/source/38>;
