<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/11792>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“When we heard back from Cambridge Analytica that they had told us they weren’t using the data and had deleted [the app], we considered it a closed case,” Zuckerberg told the Florida senator. “In retrospect, that was clearly a mistake,” he&nbsp;said.";
