<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/11786>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“We just put information into the bloodstream to the internet and then watch it grow, give it a little push every now and again over time to watch it take shape. And so this stuff infiltrates the online community and expands but with no branding – so it’s unattributable, untrackable,”&nbsp;he said.";
        schema:archivedAt        <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/11786/source/26>;
