<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/11785>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“Sometimes you can use proxy organisations who are already there. You feed them. They are civil society organisations.. Charities or activist groups, and we use them – feed them the material and they do the&nbsp;work…";
