<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/11567>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“And I want to maybe just go in the COVID example, I want to go through maybe two other ones. One that was sort of the, a very dramatic one, where I think, which is the… sort of incredible collapse of the absurdist postmodern experiment that was called Afghanistan. And, where, you know, if we discuss it in terms of military tactics, or you know, they didn’t defend the Air Force base or stuff like that, we’re ";
