<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/11461>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "&nbsp;… as we are being blunt, the fact is that Tony [Abbott] and the people who put him in his job do not want to do anything about climate change. They do not believe in human caused global warming. As Tony observed on one occasion “climate change is crap” or if you consider his mentor, Senator Minchin, the world is not warming, its cooling and the climate change issue is part of a vast left wing conspiracy to deindustrialise the&nbsp;world.";
        schema:archivedAt        <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/11461/source/>;
