<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/11456>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "It presents a really compelling case against the whole theory of anthropogenic global warming. From my point of view, it is a theory that has completely corrupted public policy making in most of the developed world.&nbsp;It confronts all the dubious claims that the warmists have put out&nbsp;there.";
        schema:archivedAt        <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/11456/source/>;
