<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/11455>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "I am flattered that Bob Carter should ask me to launch what I think is a significant new book on climate change. I have developed a very high regard for Bob in the years that I have known him.&nbsp;He has been a terrific and leading voice in combatting the scare mongering that we have all been subjected to on the theory of anthropogenic global&nbsp;warming.&nbsp;";
        schema:archivedAt        <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/11455/source/>;
