<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/11443>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“If, hypothetically, there are scientific gaps in the theory of man-made global warming, for the most part we are leaving it up to volunteers to find them. It’s as if the government has funded a team of QCs for the prosecution, but spent nothing on legal aid for the defence,” Nova ";
