<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/11391>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“I’ll fight the central planners. I’ll show you the waste in government. […] I’m a libertarian. I’ve learned that life works best when individuals are free to make our own choices and government governs best when it governs less. But that libertarian idea gets squeezed out by the louder voices in the old media. Shut up! I’m sick of them. Where’s the thoughtful debate? So that’s why I’m going to the new media: Twitter, Instagram, YouTube, Facebook. For the next chapter of my career I’ll report from here. on Reason ";
        schema:archivedAt        <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/11391/source/>;
        schema:author            <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/entity/john-stossel/>;
