        schema:abstract          "“There really is probably no category of photosynthesizing plant that does not respond in a positive manner to atmospheric CO2 enrichment, and that is not likely to be benefited by the ongoing rise in the air CO2 content.” ";
        schema:archivedAt        <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/11247/source/>;
