<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/11130>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "Developers have their bag of reusable tricks to make coding efficient. In this case, all of these sites use precisely the same CSS reset – same elements, same formatting, down to the character. Many sites will use something similar to this one, but this is exact. It’s even used on Newclear’s own custom home page. It is highly likely the same developer did all&nbsp;these&nbsp;sites.";
        schema:archivedAt        <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/11130/source/>;
