<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/11122>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "The Ethical Oil Institute claims that it is an independent, grassroots organization. It states that its website, EthicalOil.org, “began as a blog created by Alykhan Velshi” in July 2011 to promote ideas espoused by journalist Ezra Levant in his book ";
        schema:archivedAt        <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/11122/source/29>;
