<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/11006>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“I released the most extensive financial review of anybody in the history of politics,” Trump said. “It’s either 100 or maybe more pages of names of companies, locations of companies, etc., etc., and it’s a very impressive list, and everybody says that. … You don’t learn much in a tax&nbsp;return.”";
