<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/10874>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“I’m still waiting for that Big Check from Big Oil. After all, I’ve been carrying their water for years. In my case, my support of fossil fuels (and the prosperity and longevity they have enabled humanity to achieve) goes back decades. It’s a no-brainer. If there is another energy technology as cheap and reliable and large-scale, I’m all for it.”";
