<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/10873>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“Many years ago I was paid to write articles for a website called TCSDaily.com, which turned out to be fossil-fuel funded. I didn’t know that at the time, but I don’t think it would have mattered. After all, like most of us in the modern world, I’ve given far more money to fossil fuel interests than I’ve ever received from them.";
