<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/10871>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“Over the years, I’ve charged to give talks out-of-state, taking vacation time away from my research day job (which is 100% federal and state funded) to avoid any charges of “double-dipping”. A few of those talks have been for fossil fuel-related organizations, a few have been for environmental organizations, but most have not.";
