<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/10767>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "The issue of information dissemination is why I am contacting you. I am enclosing a fact sheet that if you are inclined, you could print copies for your employees and ask them to mail these to friends, relatives and acquaintances. The information could also be used for informing your members, the local media, and local and state elected officials. We plan to contact unions, other social and business groups, as well as industrial corporations served by the investor-owned utilities. We cannot allow the discussion to be monopolized by the&nbsp;alarmists.";
        schema:archivedAt        <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/10767/source/8>;
