<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/10666>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“Just because climate change has happened doesn’t mean AGW. Just because weather disasters happen doesn’t mean AGW. And an inconvenient truth that most of the media are speaking of, CAGW – that’s very important. They’re not just talking about AGW, but catastrophic [anthropogenic global warming]. If we just have a little bit of warming from manmade causes, nobody really cares, but they’re talking about it’s going to be catastrophic.”";
        schema:archivedAt        <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/10666/source/6>;
