<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/10586>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "Carlson: “If. If the ocean levels keep rising. If they do. However, I … I’m a bit skeptical because … I won’t pull it up now, but I could pull up and show you probably 500 articles on the importance of the sun in warming and cooling that have been mostly ignored in the IPCC’s models and projections of climate change.";
        schema:archivedAt        <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/10586/source/>;
