<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/10531>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "Lomborg: “Fossil fuels are just an incredible boon to civilization. And then they also have this problem. And and so that’s where we need to find a way to slowly and eventually find ways to produce all of that stuff you just talked about without the negative impact of fossil fuels. And that’s going to be hard.”";
        schema:archivedAt        <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/10531/source/>;
