<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/10508>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "Peterson: “So the, the antithesis to that is to believe in something like the Paradisal or the intrinsic Paradisal stability of well-balanced Mother Nature. It’s like, yeah, a bit, but no, not really. There’s a lot of variability, a lot. And of course that kind of variability, that’s hard on people because you want a certain amount of stability so you don’t die.”";
        schema:archivedAt        <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/10508/source/>;
