<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/10503>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "Rogan: “There’s never been a time ever environmentally where the Earth was stable. If you got, I mean, stable, you know, currently. And kind of like, guess what the weather’s going to be. But if you look at, like, models of, like, thousands of years, it’s never been flat. It’s always been up and down.”";
        schema:archivedAt        <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/10503/source/>;
