<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/10495>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“And then I criticized Justin Trudeau, and a former staff member of Justin Trudeau, and Jacinda Ardern. I made a joke about her coming. I was going to New Zealand, and the New Zealand leftist press was freaking out, and I made this joke about bringing my alt right trolls to New Zealand, and and then I put in parentheses: ‘or maybe they’re just, you know, ordinary people who are trying to clean up their rooms.’ So apparently that was casting the profession into disgrace.";
        schema:archivedAt        <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/10495/source/>;
