<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/10494>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "Jordan Peterson: “The one complaint is about the tweet I made about Ellen or Elliot Page and when I said that a criminal physician cut off her breasts and that pride was the sin. So now I’m in trouble again because I just said the same thing. One was about a ";
        schema:archivedAt        <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/10494/source/>;
        schema:author            <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/entity/joe-rogan/>;
