<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/10490>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“And then they get on these conference calls. And two of the main researchers, I believe they’re both from Scripps. They both go, yeah, I don’t know. It looks like. It could have been manufactured from a lab . . . and not from zoonotic spillover. So, so it’s even more sinister than just being arrogant. It actually looks like a cover-up.”";
        schema:archivedAt        <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/10490/source/>;
