<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/10483>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“It’s the worst thing I’ve seen professionals do, not only in my lifetime. I’ve studied atrocity for 40 years. I’ve never seen anything worse than what’s happening right now. And that includes the sorts of things that were done in the camps in Germany. At least the goddamn Nazis admitted what they did was wrong. They tried to hide it. We trumpet it as a moral virtue.”";
