        schema:abstract          "“They went after me for four reasons, probably. One of them was the entire transcript of the last conversation I had with you. Right. That was submitted as a complaint because I was talking about the climate lies. They went after me because of the comments I’ve made about the trans butchers and liars, the surgeons, and the therapists who are enabling them. That’s a major part of it.”";
