<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/10467>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“Look, everything, everything pollutes something, and so, so, the idea that there’s any source of energy that we can derive that’s not going to produce some pollutant as a consequence, that’s the kind of nonsense you hear from people who say things like ‘net zero’, ‘We’re going to hit net zero by 2050,’ it’s like, no we’re not.”";
        schema:archivedAt        <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/10467/source/>;
        schema:author            <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/entity/jordan-peterson/>;
