        schema:abstract          "“If you want to develop alternative energy sources, no problem. You know, because, hey man, the more energy sources we have, the better. But you don’t get to impose your utopian vision in the service of your narcissism on the poor. We’re going to try to make the poor rich. Going to try to alleviate absolute poverty.”";
