<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/10332>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“Many states have once again united in opposition to oppressive tyranny,” said Robert Henneke, director of the Center for the American Future. “Unfortunately, the abuse comes not from without, but directly from our federal government. The multi-state lawsuit proceeding forward today has nothing to do with the environment as the Clean Power Plan has little impact upon worldwide temperatures. Rather, the lawsuits launched today represent an assertion of Tenth Amendment sovereignty against an oppressive regime aimed at harming middle class families through higher energy costs.”";
        schema:archivedAt        <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/10332/source/89>;
        schema:author            <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/entity/texas-public-policy-foundation/>;
