<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/10311>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“As is well known, global temperatures have not risen since the beginning of the millennium, while the concentration of CO2 in the atmosphere continues to rise (from 370 to 390 millionths of atmospheric particles, or from 0.037% to 0.039%) […]&nbsp;The computer models of the UN Intergovernmental Panel on Climate Change were again&nbsp;wrong.”";
