<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/10271/source/11>
        rdf:type         schema:CreativeWork;
        schema:citation  "Russell Cook. “<a href=\"http://web.archive.org/web/20140729183808/http://www.americanthinker.com/2010/09/warmist_slander_of_scientific.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener external noreferrer\" data-wpel-link=\"external\">Warmist Slander of Scientific Skeptics</a>,” <em>American Thinker</em>, September 15, 2010. Archived July 29, 2014."^^rdf:HTML .

