<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/10193>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“On that issue, we brought together various groups within the industry. We mobilized our employes. We gained the support of small business. We worked with other trade groups and associations. And we even picked up the support of a wide range of energy consumers. In the end, we all came together and cooperated to defeat an ill-conceived and onerous proposal.”";
        schema:archivedAt        <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/10193/source/49>;
        schema:author            <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/entity/lee-raymond/>;
