        schema:abstract          "“Our first priority ought to be to improve scientific understanding. Exxon is helping with that process by conducting its own research and by supporting that of others, including a major research effort at M.I.T. on the science, economics and policy options of potential global warming.”";
        schema:archivedAt        <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/10188/source/>;
