<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/10102>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“The mayor’s plan to cut emissions by 80 percent extends out to the year 2050, meaning he’ll be long out of office once the true costs begin impact the people of Richmond. But the true costs of an unfeasible plan like this one will hurt minority and low income families every step of the way.”";
