<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/10061>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“As a start, to help in an honest resolution of these disputes, the IPCC needs to be disbanded. If necessary, by the BASIC countries withdrawing, and setting up a truly independent global scientific commission of scientists supporting the two alternative theories on global warming outlined in my previous columns. Meanwhile, to end conning the media, Dr Pachauri should issue a statement that he not be referred to as the world’s leading climate scientist. No more than Al Gore or me!”";
        schema:archivedAt        <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/10061/source/>;
        schema:author            <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/entity/deepak-lal-1940-2020/>;
