<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/10041>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "How would anyone really know if global warming is occurring? People simply don’t notice changes as small as 0.5°C, the amount of global warming over the last century. Any perceived cooling can be explained away by alarmists as just “regional variation”. It’s beautiful: this scam could go for decades.”";
        schema:archivedAt        <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/10041/source/25>;
