        schema:abstract          "“If you look at what was modeled in the ’70s, we were supposed to go through a horrible Ice Age,” Fielder said. “Global warming models predicted oceans were going to be boiling. We need to be careful about jumping on a bandwagon and saying ‘the sky is falling, and we’ve all got to do this’ based on somebody’s opinion.”";
