        schema:abstract          "“While SoCalGas feigns umbrage at the characterization of C4Bes as an astroturf or utility front group, these terms refer to exactly what is at issue here: entities who hide their sponsorship to appear independent,” attorney Matt Vespa wrote in the Sierra Club’s motion to deny C4Bes party status in the proceedings.";
