<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/9831>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“And then here’s a page from ExxonMobil’s climate carbon summary. You can see they’re all in. Paris. They’re supporting Paris. They’re into this. This is a George Shultz and those other, whatever you want to call them, Climate Leadership Council. And you know carbon tax—they’re all in, ExxonMobil. And then even the big energy users are all in. […] ";
        schema:archivedAt        <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/9831/source/>;
        schema:author            <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/entity/craig-richardson/>;
