<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/9830>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“So, this must be the market driving it right? The market must be all-in for this. So, we see what’s going on here with ExxonMobil, we know with ALEC conference, they’re pulling out. Suddenly we have an interesting thing. We have a […] can someone tell me what the ‘P’ stands for in the BP? Petroleum. So we have British Petroleum running an ad campaign saying beyond petroleum worldwide. Be like Ford Motor Company saying beyond motorcars. Can you envision it? What message that’s sending to your stockholders?";
        schema:archivedAt        <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/9830/source/>;
        schema:author            <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/entity/craig-richardson/>;
