<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/9825>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“I’m going to leave some of this at the feet of the corporations, because I think they are as much to blame for what’s going on today — in fact, they’re funding a lot of what’s going on and using environmental groups as sort of the front page,” Richardson said. ";
        schema:archivedAt        <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/9825/source/>;
