<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/9822>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "”[…] It is a communist plan, essentially, to centralize one of the most important assets of our lives—and that’s energy. […] Everybody understands, who has a brain, that this whole thing is nothing but a series of talking points in order to try to control energy, like you said, but not just from the Marxist Communist point of view, but obviously the green energy people like Tom Steyer and others and the Rockerfellers […]”";
