        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“Defendants continue to play their malicious game of defaming Dr. Mann, aptly described by the Superior Court as a ‘witch hunt,’ and have succeeded in raising hundreds of thousands of dollars through their pledge to continue their harassment of this distinguished scientist,” Mann’s lawyers said.";
