<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/9804>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“We are confident that Dr. Mann’s remaining claims will ultimately fail, because they attempt to shut down speech and debate that is absolutely protected by the First Amendment. Today’s decision only draws out Dr. Mann’s years-long effort to wage “lawfare” against his opponents instead of engaging in public debate,” Grossman said.";
