        rdf:type         schema:CreativeWork;
        schema:citation  "Stephen Marsters. “<a href=\"http://web.archive.org/web/20190425232411/https://www.dailyoilbulletin.com/article/2019/4/16/kenney-calls-on-industry-to-increase-investment-in/\" data-wpel-link=\"external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"external noopener noreferrer\">Kenney Calls On Industry To Increase Investment In Advocacy</a>,”<em> Daily Oil Bulletin, </em>April 16, 2019. Archived April 25, 2019. Archive.fo URL:<a href=\"https://archive.fo/ZsbW9\" data-wpel-link=\"external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"external noopener noreferrer\">https://archive.fo/ZsbW9</a>"^^rdf:HTML .

<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/9761>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“So I think all of those efforts together mean there is stronger advocacy, but it’s still not strong enough,” Kenney&nbsp;said. “And so I would like to see increased investment. Our oilpatch has invested a tiny fraction of a per cent of the profits that it’s generated from our resources [back into] public education and&nbsp;advocacy.”";
