<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/9686>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“Alex Epstein’s new book, The Moral Case for Fossil Fuels, needed to be written. He makes a powerful, practical case for using more, not less, fossil fuel, and his practical case is also his moral case. Thus the book’s title.”";
