<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/9635>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "More importantly, statements often appearing in the media like ‘the majority of scientists’&nbsp;believe in Global Warming, are meaningless. First of all, no legitimate survey has ever been done, and secondly, science is not about the number of people who advocate a position.”";
