<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/9601>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“Billy’s brought his toys to town, shared them and people love it,” said Sterling Varner. “Meanwhile Charles has worked his butt off here. He put his heart into building this company. He’s given millions to charity and never said anything. Billy comes to town and builds a little boathouse and he’s a hero. We must be doing something wrong. If it weren’t for Charles, Billy wouldn’t even have a rowboat.”";
        schema:archivedAt        <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/9601/source/9>;
