<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/9233>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“Maybe they do [despise that kind of activity]. But they don’t understand life and they don’t understand advocacy. I can’t help that […] I am reaching out to the fossil fuel community right now and raising money for Heartland,” he said. “Of course that’s acceptable.”";
