<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/9232>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“Though CEQ oversees the NEPA process, it remains unclear how seriously Hartnett-White will take the NEPA review process, for decades seen as a bedrock of U.S. environmental regulation since NEPA became law in 1970,” ";
