<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/9229>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“Political outcomes matter a bunch. Praise the Lord that we have Donald Trump in the Whitehouse, absolutely. We need to support this agenda, but we need to do it in a pro-people way, not in a hostile way, not in an angry way. But to put out business fact and show to the American people why coal is so important. It’s not dirty; it’s green. It’s electricity. Electricity is life. Coal is life.”";
