<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/9218>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“Once filed at EPA, ‘Saving US Coal’ will engage virtually at the state level with regulators directly and through NARUC to educate on the benefits of CO2 to the biosphere and the human environment. At the same time Craig will develop additional, original research showing the truth of CO2 which will be distributed as generated to the regulators. By doing so, coal suppliers can then engage directly with the regulators with challenges to the announced closures; rep-opening previous announcements where the plants are still operating is not out of the question.”";
        schema:archivedAt        <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/9218/source/65>;
