        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“You know, you’re going to have which essentially impact what our economic growth is, which was what was happening to my customer base. So I actually had some of our customers and a couple other people that said, hey, we’ll volunteer our time if if we can get the Railroad Commission to accept us to come in and help write guidance documents for staff members to kind of follow.";
        schema:archivedAt        <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/9162/source/6>;
