<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/9148>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“What I said about my campaign contribution is that I will not take campaign money from someone that expects a favor from that money. If you’re giving me money to my campaign, do it for the right reasons, not because you expect something in return. Just because you gave me money. I see that happen all too often. I make that crystal clear to people that say ‘hey, I’d like to contribute to the campaign’.”";
        schema:archivedAt        <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/9148/source/>;
        schema:author            <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/entity/jim-wright/>;
        schema:claimInterpreter  <http://desmog.com/>;
