        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“If they’re dirty, they’re not efficient, so they constantly have to be cleaned,” he said, referring to solar panels. “If you don’t have an environmental regulation, what are you going to use to clean them with? The most harsh detergent that you can that keeps them clean for the longest period.";
