<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/9132>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“But as far as its impact on our atmosphere, CO2 is something that is our atmosphere. You know, in CO2 has evolved as the world has evolved. You know, from the history that I read, you know the dinosaur ages, and you see the vegetation that that I’ve read about in history.";
