        schema:abstract          "“We turn to our regular commentators for their expertise and points-of-view when it comes to sports, food and the weather. But if a commentator, even on his own independent platform, delivers rhetoric that is offensive and inaccurate, we cannot support&nbsp;it.";
        schema:archivedAt        <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/9119/source/32>;
