<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/9107>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“The pro-1631 students used social media to call me all kinds of names, as did one vocal post-doctoral researcher in oceanography. They stated that I was in bed with oil companies, was on the payroll of the Koch brothers, was racist, misogynistic, a climate denier, and other names I would not repeat in a family friendly blog[…]”";
        schema:archivedAt        <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/9107/source/>;
