<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/9106>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“Mass and his (predominately climate denying allies) are engaged in a campaign to falsely claim that Mass is being persecuted, but there is no there there. Mass made problematic arguments and offensive analogies, and students have expressed frustration at his non-inclusive behavior. Far from persecuting Mass, arguably the UW has been too lenient and failed to take appropriate action. He has had no repercussions for his problematic political activities, and the only repercussions for his repeated non-inclusive behavior and harassment of others, is a politely worded letter which did not actually address Mass, and a meeting wherein students expressed frustration about Mass’ behavior, hardly a campaign of persecution.”";
        schema:archivedAt        <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/9106/source/>;
        schema:author            <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/entity/clifford-mass/>;
