<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/9096>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“This is a total lie. I never said that and never stuck any fingers in anyone’s face. Sarah Myhre choose to defame me and call me names in her testimony. I had never heard of her before that. Several folks emailed me after her testimony telling me that she was ‘throwing me under the bus.’ Her efforts to paint me as an extremist was both wrong and unnecessary, particularly as I not only am concerned about climate change, but was a major supporter of the carbon tax initiative.”";
        schema:archivedAt        <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/9096/source/>;
