<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/9071>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“A recent blog post by Judith Curry, ‘The Blame Game,’&nbsp;put the science back into sea level—at least the best research we have now. Yes, sea level is rising, but such is also the natural state of things coming out of the Little Ice Age that ended in the mid-19th century,” The IER&nbsp;noted.";
        schema:archivedAt        <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/9071/source/67>;
        schema:author            <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/entity/institute-energy-research/>;
