<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/8930>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“And I’m doing this pro bono. […] We spent about less than $5,000 this week and that money, about five grand came from Canada action, Cody Battershill. He’s a realtor in Calgary and […] he gave that money to a small group called The North Matters.”";
