<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/8889>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“That’s what they’re trying to do with global warming, use it to convince everyone to go to renewables, that we have to go to a more expensive type of energy, foisting this idea to do solar and wind facilities,” said investigative journalist Vivian Krause. “This is really about two groups of people and two very different views of how they want the world to run.”";
