<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/8610>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“That debate is far from settled. Scientists continue to disagree about the degree and extent of global warming and its connection to the actions of mankind. That debate should be encouraged — in classrooms, public forums, and the halls of Congress. It should not be silenced with threats of prosecution. Dissent is not a crime.”";
