<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/8434>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“Remember when kids used to tell their teachers, ‘the dog ate my homework.’ Well, now we’ve got some climate change scientists who might as well be saying the same thing about the raw data backing up their research. A lot of the data is incomplete, inconsistent and just flat out wrong,” Morano said.";
