<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/8429>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“I have listened carefully, and I can inform Your Holiness that science is divided on the climate question. A small number of totalitarian profiteers of doom in various self-serving national academies have issued pompous statements about it, but a large number of papers from reputable scientists, and a larger amount of hard data, suggest that global warming is and will continue to be a non-event.”";
