        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“They’re just trying to shock the public so that we’ll take action on climate, turn to central planning, give up liberty, give up free markets, in order to save us from a climate calamity, and, apparently now, cannibalism it’ll save us from. So if we go socialist, hey, we don’t need to eat humans.”";
