<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/8377>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "Well, given the age of virus scares, and we’re all supposed to be terrified of all these viruses now, why would you want to pack on mass transit that’s green-approved? Why would you want to take the subway system? Why would you want to be on the commuter train when you can take your glorious fossil-fuelled car in isolation away from the virus. So, I would argue, let’s turn the fears around, you know, where necessary to throw it back at them.";
        schema:archivedAt        <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/8377/source/22>;
