<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/8373>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“[00:59:41]&nbsp;I think we have to acknowledge at a national level that lockdowns, there’s no science to support essentially that they work. Especially, I can understand a flattening the curve or at least some kind of limited. Very limited. But you don’t lockdown… We need to acknowledge that they were wrong and not allow future lockdowns. That’s number one.";
        schema:archivedAt        <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/8373/source/19>;
        schema:author            <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/entity/marc-morano/>;
        schema:claimInterpreter  <http://desmog.com/>;
        schema:inLanguage        "English"^^schema:Text;
        schema:publisher         <http://desmog.com/>;
        schema:url               "https://www.desmog.com/marc-morano/" .

