        rdf:type         schema:CreativeWork;
        schema:citation  "“<a href=\"https://youtu.be/FcfROTcZ3QM?t=10m2s\" data-wpel-link=\"external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"external noopener noreferrer\">ClimateGate: the Fraud of ‘Global Warming’ and ‘Climate Change’ — by Marc Morano of Climate Depot</a>,” YouTube Video. Uploaded by TCCTV on November 24, 2009."^^rdf:HTML .

<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/8370>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“The bottom line is, not only do we not face a climate crisis, but if we face a climate crisis what Congress is proposing, what the United Nations is proposing, is scientifically meaningless. It would have no detectable impact. So we’d all be doomed if we had to rely on them for a solution.”";
