<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/8343>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“… So I wrote her [the attorney general’s] office and I just had a three word message: It was regarding, you know, your, your demand to seize my emails. I just wrote ‘fuck off fascist’ and I posted it on the internet. It was the most popular thing I ever&nbsp;posted.”";
        schema:archivedAt        <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/8343/source/>;
