<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/8307>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“If Nye’s followers and their networks are made aware of a live event or recording in which Nye’s position is shown to be unscientific (and immoral) and are exposed to a pro-human, big picture way of thinking about fossil fuels, it could create a measurable shift in how the youth view fossil fuels,” ";
