<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/8300>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "Today, most mainstream researchers consider Dr. Lindzen’s theory discredited. He published a paper in 2009 offering more support for his case,&nbsp;but once again, scientists identified errors, including a failure to account for known inaccuracies in satellite measurements. Dr Lindzen acknowledged that the 2009 paper contained some ‘stupid mistakes.’ ‘It was just embarrassing,’ he said in an&nbsp;interview.”";
        schema:archivedAt        <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/8300/source/>;
