<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/8168>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“[T]oday’s vaunted “climate science consensus”—that it’s been scientifically proven that we need to dismantle the fossil fuel industry, the economic engine of the world—is more Scientology than science,” he wrote.";
