<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/8106>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“ESG is alluring because it suggests that you can get rich while doing good for the world. As usual, when something seems too good to be true, it is. Investing for doing good will sometimes generate higher returns, though clean tech is crashing right now, but if this was true in general, everyone would be doing good and you wouldn’t need ESG.”";
        schema:archivedAt        <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/8106/source/>;
