<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/8046/source/51>
        rdf:type         schema:CreativeWork;
        schema:citation  "Bjorn Lomborg.&nbsp;”<a href=\"http://www.theaustralian.com.au/opinion/columnists/renewables-pave-path-to-poverty/story-fni1hfs5-1226898730123\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener external\" data-wpel-link=\"external\">Renewables pave path to poverty</a>,”&nbsp;<em>The Australian</em>, April 29, 2014. Archived May 8, 2014. Archived .pdf on file at&nbsp;DeSmog."^^rdf:HTML .

