        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“The fact about global climate change is that while there’s a consensus among scientists that the world has warmed in the last quarter century, there is tremendous scientific uncertainty about how much climate is likely to change in the future and what precisely humans role in that change is,” Glassman ";
