        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“The information that I have so far reviewed leaves it unclear whether the glass is half empty or half full. On the one hand, I think that there is good reason to believe that the threat from global warming is overstated, which would be welcome news if true. On the other hand, if it is not overstated, I have sought to explain what I believe to be the major shortfalls of all current and proposed solutions.”";
