        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“The University has existing protocols in place that require approval for all grant proposals,” Gatlin said. “The Beacon Hill Institute’s grant proposal did not go through the university’s approval process. The university would not have authorized this grant proposal as written.”&nbsp;";
