<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/7856>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“We are about to incur a host of taxes, levies and incentives, all driven by T-shirt slogans, which are, in turn, driven by junk science and junk economics. Any technologies we develop will address the needs of only those markets suffering similar distortions. We are unlikely to develop anything of use to Europe’s nuclear sector or their waste-to-energy plants. We have already rejected both responses to the [Kyoto] protocol.”";
        schema:archivedAt        <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/7856/source/>;
