<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/7823>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "But we account for less than two percent of global carbon emissions. And so it is crazy for us–we can’t do anything on our own–and if the rest of the world […] is not going to go down this route […] it’s not doing any&nbsp;good.&nbsp;";
        schema:archivedAt        <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/7823/source/>;
        schema:author            <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/entity/nigel-lawson/>;
