<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/7820/source/83>
        rdf:type         schema:CreativeWork;
        schema:citation  "“<a href=\"https://www.mediamatters.org/media/4001317\" data-wpel-link=\"external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"external noopener noreferrer\">From the February 22, 2023, edition of Fox Business’ Varney &amp; Co.,</a>” <em>Media Matters</em>. Archived .mp4 on file at DeSmog."^^rdf:HTML .

<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/7820>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“So I’m an unapologetic America First conservative. I do not apologize about that. But I think to put America first, we need to go further and rediscover what America is. So what I call kind of America First 2.0. And so, you know what? I agree with a lot of President Trump’s policies. I was a big fan of them at the time. I’ve said so many times over. Maybe a little less government spending, but put that to one side. I think the key point for me is revive an American national agenda. I mean, reject affirmative action. Get rid of this climate religion. Lead to this national revival at home that allows us to then stand up to the actual threats we face, like communist China.”";
        schema:archivedAt        <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/7820/source/83>;
        schema:author            <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/entity/vivek-ramaswamy/>;
        schema:claimInterpreter  <http://desmog.com/>;
        schema:inLanguage        "English"^^schema:Text;
        schema:publisher         <http://desmog.com/>;
        schema:url               "https://www.desmog.com/vivek-ramaswamy/" .

<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/7819/source/82>
        rdf:type         schema:CreativeWork;
        schema:citation  "“<a href=\"https://www.mediamatters.org/media/4001401\" data-wpel-link=\"external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"external noopener noreferrer\">From the February 22, 2023, edition of Fox News’ Fox &amp; Friends</a>,” <em>Media Matters</em>. Archived .mp4 on file at DeSmog."^^rdf:HTML .

<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/7819>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“As much as I’ve been complaining about woke culture and identifying that problem, I think the way we solve it is by delivering an American national identity that is so powerful that it dilutes those woke agendas to irrelevance.”";
        schema:archivedAt        <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/7819/source/82>;
        schema:author            <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/entity/vivek-ramaswamy/>;
        schema:claimInterpreter  <http://desmog.com/>;
        schema:inLanguage        "English"^^schema:Text;
        schema:publisher         <http://desmog.com/>;
        schema:url               "https://www.desmog.com/vivek-ramaswamy/" .

<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/7818/source/82>
        rdf:type         schema:CreativeWork;
        schema:citation  "“<a href=\"https://www.mediamatters.org/media/4001401\" data-wpel-link=\"external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"external noopener noreferrer\">From the February 22, 2023, edition of Fox News’ Fox &amp; Friends</a>,” <em>Media Matters</em>. Archived .mp4 on file at DeSmog."^^rdf:HTML .

<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/7818>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“I think it’s important to see the problem with clear eyes: The rise of secular religions like wokeness and climateism in America,” he said.";
        schema:archivedAt        <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/7818/source/82>;
        schema:author            <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/entity/vivek-ramaswamy/>;
        schema:claimInterpreter  <http://desmog.com/>;
        schema:inLanguage        "English"^^schema:Text;
        schema:publisher         <http://desmog.com/>;
        schema:url               "https://www.desmog.com/vivek-ramaswamy/" .

<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/7817/source/74>
        rdf:type         schema:CreativeWork;
        schema:citation  "Glenn Kessler. “<a href=\"https://www.washingtonpost.com/politics/2023/08/25/vivek-ramaswamy-says-hoax-agenda-kills-more-people-than-climate-change/\" data-wpel-link=\"external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"external noopener noreferrer\">Vivek Ramaswamy says ‘hoax’ agenda kills more people than climate change</a>,” <em>The Washington Post</em>, August 25, 2023. Archived August 29, 2023. Archive URL: <a href=\"https://archive.ph/oymb5\" data-wpel-link=\"external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"external noopener noreferrer\">https://archive.ph/oymb5</a>"^^rdf:HTML .

<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/7817>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“No matter how you slice it, credible research has concluded that thousands of people a year die because of the effects of climate change. We can’t find data that suggests green energy policies actually kill even more people — and Ramaswamy’s campaign did not provide any source for his claim. He earns Four Pinocchios.”";
        schema:archivedAt        <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/7817/source/74>;
        schema:author            <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/entity/vivek-ramaswamy/>;
        schema:claimInterpreter  <http://desmog.com/>;
        schema:inLanguage        "English"^^schema:Text;
        schema:publisher         <http://desmog.com/>;
        schema:url               "https://www.desmog.com/vivek-ramaswamy/" .

<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/7816/source/73>
        rdf:type         schema:CreativeWork;
        schema:citation  "“<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=D3KH0GMZxzQ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener nofollow external\" data-wpel-link=\"external\">At first GOP debate, Ramaswamy becomes chief target,</a>” YouTube video uploaded by user “NBC News,” August 23, 2023. Archived .mp4 on file at DeSmog."^^rdf:HTML .

<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/7816>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“Let us be honest as Republicans. I am the only person on the stage who isn’t bought and paid for so I can say this. The climate change agenda is a hoax. The climate change agenda is a hoax, and we have to declare independence. And the reality is, the anti-carbon agenda is the wet blanket on our economy, and so the reality is more people are dying of bad climate change policies than they are of actual climate change.”";
        schema:archivedAt        <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/7816/source/73>;
        schema:author            <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/entity/vivek-ramaswamy/>;
        schema:claimInterpreter  <http://desmog.com/>;
        schema:inLanguage        "English"^^schema:Text;
        schema:publisher         <http://desmog.com/>;
        schema:url               "https://www.desmog.com/vivek-ramaswamy/" .

<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/7815/source/71>
        rdf:type         schema:CreativeWork;
        schema:citation  "“<a href=\"https://www.mediamatters.org/media/4001320\" data-wpel-link=\"external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"external noopener noreferrer\">From the February 23, 2023, edition of Fox News’ Hannity</a>,” <em>Media Matters for America</em>. Archived .mp4 on file at DeSmog."^^rdf:HTML .

<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/7815>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“I am dismantling this climate religion. We have been addicted to a climate religion that shackled the United States while leaving China untouched. So I think it’s about taking it to the next level as far as I see it.”";
        schema:archivedAt        <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/7815/source/71>;
        schema:author            <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/entity/vivek-ramaswamy/>;
        schema:claimInterpreter  <http://desmog.com/>;
        schema:inLanguage        "English"^^schema:Text;
        schema:publisher         <http://desmog.com/>;
        schema:url               "https://www.desmog.com/vivek-ramaswamy/" .

<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/7814/source/71>
        rdf:type         schema:CreativeWork;
        schema:citation  "“<a href=\"https://www.mediamatters.org/media/4001320\" data-wpel-link=\"external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"external noopener noreferrer\">From the February 23, 2023, edition of Fox News’ Hannity</a>,” <em>Media Matters for America</em>. Archived .mp4 on file at DeSmog."^^rdf:HTML .

<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/7814>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“I am going to shut down federal agencies. Earlier today, I put out my proposal to actually shut down the Department of Education, which should not exist. That’s just the first of many government agencies that I am pledging to shut down as the next president.";
        schema:archivedAt        <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/7814/source/71>;
        schema:author            <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/entity/vivek-ramaswamy/>;
        schema:claimInterpreter  <http://desmog.com/>;
        schema:inLanguage        "English"^^schema:Text;
        schema:publisher         <http://desmog.com/>;
        schema:url               "https://www.desmog.com/vivek-ramaswamy/" .

<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/7813/source/>
        rdf:type         schema:CreativeWork;
        schema:citation  ""^^rdf:HTML .

<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/7813>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“One is, I think it actually leads companies to be less successful over the long run. Milton Friedman made that case. I’ve made a revised case of it in my book, Margaret. That’s not even my main reason for being against it. My main reason for being against this trend of stakeholder capitalism, what you could also refer to as woke capitalism, is that it is a perversion of how a constitutional republic, a democratic society is supposed to work. What the model of stakeholder capitalism calls for us to say that, no, no, no, we the people, can’t be trusted to sort out our differences on climate change or on social justice, but that we have to actually trust an enlightened group of elites to determine for the rest of society what the right answers are to those questions. Using commerce as a vehicle to do it. And so you want to talk about threats to democracy. I think that’s pretty high on the list, actually. And that’s been the source of my criticism over the last several years.”";
        schema:archivedAt        <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/7813/source/>;
        schema:author            <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/entity/vivek-ramaswamy/>;
        schema:claimInterpreter  <http://desmog.com/>;
        schema:inLanguage        "English"^^schema:Text;
        schema:publisher         <http://desmog.com/>;
        schema:url               "https://www.desmog.com/vivek-ramaswamy/" .

<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/7812/source/>
        rdf:type         schema:CreativeWork;
        schema:citation  ""^^rdf:HTML .

<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/7812>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“So I’ll start with what wokeism is. It is a worldview that says that your identity is based on your race, your gender, your sexual orientation, or other genetically inherited attributes. That we we are either oppressors or oppressed based on those genetic characteristics. And that it is our obligation to reorder those injustices and social relationships. Woke capitalism is the extension of using capitalism commerce as a means to address those injustices, racial injustice and climate change. I think that this is a mistake on two counts.";
        schema:archivedAt        <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/7812/source/>;
        schema:author            <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/entity/vivek-ramaswamy/>;
        schema:claimInterpreter  <http://desmog.com/>;
        schema:inLanguage        "English"^^schema:Text;
        schema:publisher         <http://desmog.com/>;
        schema:url               "https://www.desmog.com/vivek-ramaswamy/" .

<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/7811/source/>
        rdf:type         schema:CreativeWork;
        schema:citation  ""^^rdf:HTML .

<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/7811>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“If the facts are dramatically different, we’re talking about selling secrets to foreign adversaries, for example, I would change my judgment on that. But on these facts, there’s no doubt that I will pardon Donald Trump, because I think that’s the right thing for the country.”";
        schema:archivedAt        <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/7811/source/>;
        schema:author            <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/entity/vivek-ramaswamy/>;
        schema:claimInterpreter  <http://desmog.com/>;
        schema:inLanguage        "English"^^schema:Text;
        schema:publisher         <http://desmog.com/>;
        schema:url               "https://www.desmog.com/vivek-ramaswamy/" .

<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/7810/source/70>
        rdf:type         schema:CreativeWork;
        schema:citation  "“<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=r8EncVFK-IM\" data-wpel-link=\"external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"external noopener noreferrer\">Vivek Ramaswamy | Full Episode 8.4.23 | Firing Line with Margaret Hoover | PBS,</a>” YouTube video uploaded by user “Firing Line with Margaret Hoover,” August 4, 2023. Archived .mp4 on file at DeSmog."^^rdf:HTML .

<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/7810>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“The narrow answer is I would pardon him because I think that his behaviors did not obviously constitute illegal violation, even as stated in those indictments. That’s the narrow answer. The deeper answer and the one that really moves me is that I think it will set an awful national precedent for us to become a country in which the ruling party, whoever it is, uses police power to indict its political rivals. That is the stuff of banana republics. That is not the stuff of the United States of America.”";
        schema:archivedAt        <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/7810/source/70>;
        schema:author            <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/entity/vivek-ramaswamy/>;
        schema:claimInterpreter  <http://desmog.com/>;
        schema:inLanguage        "English"^^schema:Text;
        schema:publisher         <http://desmog.com/>;
        schema:url               "https://www.desmog.com/vivek-ramaswamy/" .

<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/7809/source/68>
        rdf:type         schema:CreativeWork;
        schema:citation  "“<a href=\"https://abcnews.go.com/Politics/video/vivek-ramaswamy-trump-excellent-america-outsider-president-102365410\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener external\" data-wpel-link=\"external\">Vivek Ramaswamy: Trump was ‘excellent,’ but America ‘needs an outsider’ as president</a>,” <em>ABC News</em>, August 21, 2023. Archived .mp4 on file at DeSmog."^^rdf:HTML .

<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/7809>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“The truth is I’m going further than Trump did. Building the wall is insufficient. There are cartel finance tunnels underneath that wall. I support using the U.S. military to secure our southern border.”";
        schema:archivedAt        <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/7809/source/68>;
        schema:author            <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/entity/vivek-ramaswamy/>;
        schema:claimInterpreter  <http://desmog.com/>;
        schema:inLanguage        "English"^^schema:Text;
        schema:publisher         <http://desmog.com/>;
        schema:url               "https://www.desmog.com/vivek-ramaswamy/" .

<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/7808/source/67>
        rdf:type         schema:CreativeWork;
        schema:citation  "“<a href=\"https://abcnews.go.com/Politics/video/vivek-ramaswamy-trump-excellent-america-outsider-president-102365410\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener external\" data-wpel-link=\"external\">Vivek Ramaswamy: Trump was ‘excellent,’ but America ‘needs an outsider’ as president</a>,” <em>ABC News</em>, August 21, 2023. Archived .mp4 on file at DeSmog."^^rdf:HTML .

<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/7808>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“I call it America First 2.0, and the reality is, I think Trump was an excellent President. He laid a great foundation on policies that many people who aren’t even Republicans quietly agree with now. Building the border wall — controversial then, widely accepted today.";
        schema:archivedAt        <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/7808/source/67>;
