<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/7794>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "40 years ago they told us an ice age was imminent. Now they tell us that the global warming is an existential threat to humanity. Which is it? Neither. The climate change agenda is a hoax because it has nothing to do with the climate and everything with global “equity” – by… ";
        schema:archivedAt        <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/7794/source/>;
        schema:author            <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/entity/vivek-ramaswamy/>;
