<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/7781>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“I’m here to encourage everyone to look at the data themselves, not just buy what they’re told. I find that my standards for science are more important to me than anything else, and I hate to see them being depreciated by the alarmists’ claims today. Politics and the media and what have you have allowed us now to be facing one of the biggest scientific hoaxes in history. That’s what’s being pushed on us.”";
