<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/7764>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“Scientists see no temperature increase (on average) in the oceans or on the surface of the Earth over the last decade. That hasn’t stopped an activist group from infiltrating high schools with the panicky message that we are on the verge of a “planetary emergency” due to global warming.”";
