<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/7763>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“The truth is, read any legitimate scientific study on climate – including IPCC’s – that suggests human influence is the dominant cause for global warming, and you will discover dozens of qualifiers like ‘could,’ ‘possibly,’ ‘potentially,’ and ‘may.’ For all the certainty and consensus that global warming fear-mongers assert, those sound a lot like weasel words.”";
        schema:archivedAt        <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/7763/source/4>;
