        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“Oregon isn’t a state that likes outside interference,” DeFazio said. “Once we focused on who Mercer was we began to move our poll numbers.” DeFazio won. This year, Robinson is running again to oust DeFazio, but Mercer hasn’t dropped mega-dollars into the race. Robinson declined comment for this story.";
