<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/7696>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“[T]here is a swindle by scientists, politicians and most green organisations regarding the health of the Great Barrier Reef (GBR). We are told that the reef is a third of the way to ecological extinction, is being smothered by sediments, is polluted by nutrients and pesticides, and is being cooked by global warming. Some scientists and organisations give the reef only a couple of decades before it is finished.";
        schema:archivedAt        <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/7696/source/17>;
        schema:author            <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/entity/peter-ridd/>;
