<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/7666>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“Further, federal programs designed to fund climate alarmism have been frozen and are under review. And Barack Obama’s job-killing and economy disrupting ‘Clean Power Plan’ has effectively been cancelled.”";
