<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/7655>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“Prior to joining Direct Impact, Dittus was the Washington Director of BMc Strategies. She developed national and regional coalitions in support of legislative efforts on acid rain, nuclear power, and transportation issues, including the successful effort to defeat acid rain legislation in the 100th Congress.";
