<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/7602>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“Unlike so many of my colleagues, who are caught up in climate change hysteria, I am confident that ‘man-made’&nbsp;global warming&nbsp;does not pose a catastrophic threat (as Al Gore says) to the future of mankind and the Earth itself,” Coleman wrote. “I’ve studied this subject for decades. I know beyond any doubt the science behind the global warming frenzy is based on a completely failed theory. There is nothing alarming in any of the actual evidence.”";
