        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“The reality is that politicians who say government ‘can do something about&nbsp;droughts, floods, sea levels, hurricanes, and tornadoes are practicing the equivalent of medieval&nbsp;witchcraft.”";
