        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“There is evidence that when the environmentalists ‘win’, America loses without a doubt,&nbsp;but specifically these small towns and these people lose tremendously. So I started Power the Future to fight for both things: to fight for energy workers and&nbsp;their rights, but also to unmask the inauthenticity of these green radical groups.”";
