        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“Trump will use the ‘Green New Deal’ to his electoral advantage, and he should. It is a sophomoric, outlandish and fairly un-American proposal. The left’s efforts to elevate the ‘Green New Deal’&nbsp;to the 2020 campaign is both a policy debacle and a repeat of Clinton’s political&nbsp;blunder.”";
