        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“The UK paper industry is very energy intensive. CHP [combined heat and power] is crucial to the process in maintaining cost effectiveness as well as the achievement of our climate change targets. It should, in our view, be exempted from the climate change levy.”";
