<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/7459>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“Please consider supporting the Heartland Institute. These conferences are expensive, and I’m not a good fundraiser so as a result I don’t raise enough money to cover them, we really scramble to make payroll as a result to cover these expenses. If you can afford to make a contribution, please do. If you know someone, if you’ve got a rich uncle or somebody in the family or somebody that you work with, please give them a call and ask them if they would consider making a tax-deductable contribution to the Heartland Institute.”";
        schema:archivedAt        <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/7459/source/128>;
