<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/7458>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "The point is that believing in global warming is not “mainstream,” smart, or sophisticated. In fact, it is just the opposite of those things. Still believing in man-made global warming – after all the scientific discoveries and revelations that point against this theory – is more than a little nutty. In fact, some really crazy people use it to justify immoral and frightening behavior.”";
