        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "[00:51:33] the left wishes to obliterate all distinctions. Man is God. Oh, another distinction. Man and animal. We are man. The human being is just another animal. There is no gender distinction there. It’s non-binary. That’s their phrase that they use. Good and evil are matters of opinion. One man’s good is another man’s evil and one man’s freedom fighter. Another is another man’s terrorist. They are obliterating all&nbsp;distinctions.";
