        schema:abstract          "“We have many great Republican members of Congress and candidates who are very supportive of the Make America Great Again agenda. Like me, they love the United States of America and are helping to finally take our country back and build it up, rather than simply seeking to burn it all down.”";
        schema:archivedAt        <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/7323/source/55>;
