        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“I’m thinking of this incredible interference in the way that we live our lives even to the extent of being told to hug our dogs and then I ask the question: Where will I find a messiah to reveal the untruths to us and smite the unrighteous and drive these people from the temple? And then a voice comes to me from the Czech Republic.”";
