<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/7272>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“The Met Office description should have been mentioned in Mr Bolt’s print article and blog of 1 February, even if he then rebutted it as unconvincing. It was not sufficient in these circumstances to assert ignorance of the response or to rely on the reader’s previous posting to inform other readers about it.”";
        schema:archivedAt        <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/7272/source/42>;
