        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "[…] the 2nd thing is that we have to cur our emissions. Cut this plant food that we’re putting into the atmosphere. Now, to cut that, we build wind industrial complexes and solar complexes. Now, the amount of toxins that we release, the amount of carbon dioxide to build them, and to maintain them, to transport the products, doesn’t save anything.”";
        schema:archivedAt        <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/7270/source/30>;
