<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/7257>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“I know that there is a debate about [humans causing the warming of the planet] – that’s all I am prepared to say. I’m not a scientist but when someone tells me that all the scientists agree, I say no they don’t. They all agree that there’s a tendency for human emissions to heat the planet, but whether that’s responsible for all the heating is an open question. But I must say that once it was confidently predicted that there was run away warming and now we have had a pause for 16 years. Now please explain that.”";
        schema:archivedAt        <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/7257/source/6>;
        schema:author            <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/entity/andrew-bolt/>;
        schema:claimInterpreter  <http://desmog.com/>;
        schema:inLanguage        "English"^^schema:Text;
        schema:publisher         <http://desmog.com/>;
        schema:url               "https://www.desmog.com/andrew-bolt/" .

