        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“The Climate Action Partnership, an alliance of environmental and business groups, has been promoted as an example of responsible leaders seeking to protect our planet. Perhaps. But when businessmen seek, politically, to achieve what they cannot achieve in the marketplace, we should all be a bit skeptical,” he said.";
