        schema:abstract          "“For example, see the Mark-Udall-for-Senate campaign’s recent claim that Charles and David Koch want to ‘trap … Colorado families in poverty.’ This comment echoes Senate Majority Leader Harry Reid’s recent statement that the Kochs are ‘un-American.’ Such attacks are directed at everyone who supports the same causes as the Kochs, including the two of us.”";
        schema:archivedAt        <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/7125/source/55>;
        schema:author            <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/entity/chris-wright/>;
        schema:claimInterpreter  <http://desmog.com/>;
        schema:inLanguage        "English"^^schema:Text;
        schema:publisher         <http://desmog.com/>;
        schema:url               "https://www.desmog.com/chris-wright/" .

<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/7124/source/56>
        rdf:type         schema:CreativeWork;
        schema:citation  "“<a href=\"http://web.archive.org/web/20241217222758/https://www.denverpost.com/2014/10/17/we-want-to-help-the-poor-as-do-the-koch-brothers/\" data-wpel-link=\"external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"external noopener noreferrer\">We want to help the poor, as do the Koch brothers</a>,” <em>The Denver Post</em>, April 26, 2016. Archived December 17, 2024. Archive URL: <a href=\"https://archive.ph/2cVRN\" data-wpel-link=\"external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"external noopener noreferrer\">https://archive.ph/2cVRN</a>"^^rdf:HTML .

<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/7124>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "They added, “Politicians in Colorado and bureaucrats in Washington are trying to curtail or shut down fracking altogether. Our industry now has to divert efforts away from improvements in fracking technology — which will bring economic benefits to a larger number of people — and toward government lobbying.”";
        schema:archivedAt        <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/7124/source/56>;
        schema:author            <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/entity/chris-wright/>;
