<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/7063>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“Our energy industry in this country freed the world from tyranny,” he said. “Our ability to be energy independent will continue to deliver those kinds of promises to the rest of the world. So please, I gotta tell you, I’m with you. I appreciate what you do in the energy industry, and if we stay active and if we stay on message, America will absolutely be great again.";
        schema:archivedAt        <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/7063/source/37>;
