        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "You know, it’s true that regulations like this would have a secondary effect of, you know, affecting emissions of other pollutants, but we have ample and abundant regulatory authority to deal with all the pollution that we’re responsible for under the clean air act. And, in this case, the proposed ACE rule would be very effective in dealing with greenhouse gas emissions from power plants and it would complement the broad suite of other very aggressive standards we have in place for other types of pollution.”";
