        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“…and many people have been led to believe that the so-called separation clause is actually part of the United States Constitution. And they cite it all the time to suggest that religion shouldn’t have any influence at all over our decisions in the legislatures and the public squares, etc. But that look, that’s not right at all.";
