<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/6874>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“‘What is a woman?’ We’ve all seen the cultural war on women escalate alarmingly in recent days. Judges can’t define what a woman is. Sports teams allow men on women’s teams because they refuse to acknowledge even the most basic differences between men and women. Terminology that was once exclusive to women is now inclusive (e.g., pregnant&nbsp;";
        schema:archivedAt        <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/6874/source/74>;
        schema:author            <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/entity/mike-johnson/>;
