<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/6841>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“The march of wokeism, like the march of Islamism, is more than an intellectual movement. It has already claimed many innocent victims, from university professors to stand-up comedians. And its victims include its supposed beneficiaries. Many mayors, police officials, and public prosecutors have responded to the ‘Black Lives Matter’ and ‘Defund the Police’ movements by handcuffing police protection in many neighborhoods and effectively decriminalizing looting, shoplifting, and similar offenses. These steps, taken in the name of ‘social justice,’ have produced a surge in urban crime and killing that has disproportionately afflicted black citizens. Similarly, the aggressive promotion of sex-change surgery on unwitting children has left many girls (and boys) permanently disfigured.”";
        schema:archivedAt        <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/6841/source/>;
        schema:author            <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/entity/christopher-demuth/>;
        schema:claimInterpreter  <http://desmog.com/>;
