        schema:citation  "Damian Carrington. “<a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/environment/2023/aug/01/leak-uae-presidency-un-climate-summit-oil-gas-emissions-yemen\" data-wpel-link=\"external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"external noopener noreferrer\">Leak reveals ‘touchy’ issues for UAE’s presidency of UN climate summit</a>,” <em>The Guardian</em>, August 1, 2023. <a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20230821191917/https://www.theguardian.com/environment/2023/aug/01/leak-uae-presidency-un-climate-summit-oil-gas-emissions-yemen\" data-wpel-link=\"external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"external noopener noreferrer\">Archived August 21, 2023</a>. Archive URL: <a href=\"https://archive.ph/w8z0D\" data-wpel-link=\"external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"external noopener noreferrer\">https://archive.ph/w8z0D</a>"^^rdf:HTML .

