<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/6674>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“The document also lists responses to a long series of sensitive issues unrelated to climate and energy including: money laundering, war crimes in Yemen, political prisoners, surveillance and spying, LGBTQIA+ community, freedom of expression, women’s rights and people trafficking. Homosexual sex is illegal in the UAE and journalists have to be registered with the state.”";
