<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/6672>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“For billions of people, the outcome of COP28 and following international climate negotiations will make the difference between life and death, chaos and solidarity,” said MEP Manon Aubry, one of the signatories. “Corporate greed and lobbyists’ lies have led us into this climate crisis. We must prevent private interests from interfering in politics and regain ownership of our future.”";
