        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“We know that the energies used today will continue to be part of the global energy mix for the foreseeable future, and as such, we will continue to work with the world to decarbonize the current energy system while we build the new energy system that is capable of transitioning even the most heavy emitting industries,” he said.";
        schema:archivedAt        <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/6669/source/>;
