<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/6668>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“We will accelerate delivery in sectors like renewables that must triple capacity by 2030 and double that again by 2040. We will encourage smart government regulation to jump start the hydrogen value chain and make carbon capture commercially viable. And the public, multilateral, and private sectors must be mobilized in new and innovative ways on the critical issue of climate finance,” he added. [52:35]";
        schema:archivedAt        <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/6668/source/>;
