<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/6621>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "In this book I hold those environmental alarmists strictly accountable for their faulty analyses, their wildly inaccurate predictions, and their heedless politicization of science, in the hope that the next generation will not grow up feeling that their future is dismal and blighted. This book demonstrates the reality of human progress, and I hope it will thereby help restore the next generation’s belief in the future.”";
        schema:archivedAt        <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/6621/source/11>;
        schema:author            <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/entity/ronald-bailey/>;
