        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“It’s an absolute fraud, Trump’s done the right thing… I have seen scientists virtually on their knees begging for grants from the EU, grants from these kind of climate change funds… I have seen them scaremongering, I have seen them using data in interesting ways to make the problem seem worse in order to secure funding, in order to secure their jobs.”";
