<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/6485>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“It would be the first time that man has ever been responsible for it [warming] in recorded history. We go back ten million years, and if you’re going to actually believe what we have as the reference records, there’s no linkage to CO2 and temperature. Unless of course it’s one of these books, these 3d books, you gotta stand on your head and cross your eyes to look at.”";
