<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/6383>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“My comment to the committee when something like that was asked to me a month ago was, ‘Mother Nature has within her all the necessary tools to generate extreme events that exceed what we have seen in the past 50 years.’ So, whatever we have seen out there, Mother Nature already has the ability to do&nbsp;it.”";
        schema:archivedAt        <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/6383/source/50>;
        schema:author            <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/entity/steve-koonin/>;
