<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/6337>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“We often hear that there is a ‘scientific consensus’&nbsp;about climate change. But as far as the computer models go, there isn’t a useful consensus at the level of detail relevant to assessing human&nbsp;influences.”";
