<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/6320>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“Western Wire is a project of Western Energy Alliance, a non-profit regional oil and natural gas association based in Denver, Colo., and active across 13 states. The Alliance works closely with stakeholders in state and local government; academia; ranching; other industries; think tanks; and sportsmen’s, civic, business, issue advocacy and other groups. These allies share an interest in a vibrant western economy with robust job&nbsp;creation”";
        schema:archivedAt        <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/6320/source/29>;
