<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/6274>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“What I put down for him was what I call an all-of-the-above energy paper highlighting North Dakota’s assets of oil, wind, ethanol, coal, of course, and how addressing greenhouse gas emissions does not require throwing fossil fuels under the bus. We can have policies that say all American-made energy can be a winner,” Cramer said.";
