<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/6254>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“Global warming is only one of the supposedly human-caused ‘crises’ that are severely questioned by genuine scientists. The latter often are too busy working on genuine problems to take the time to refute the sensational assertions of the ‘activists’&nbsp;so avidly reported by the media. If the socialist agenda that has become the goal of the so-called environmentalists is advanced, the material costs will be huge and the benefits small. The ultimate cost would be human&nbsp;freedom.”";
        schema:archivedAt        <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/6254/source/31>;
        schema:author            <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/entity/american-institute-economic-research/>;
