<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/6227>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“So, what is the bottom line? If global warming will only reduce the annual growth rate in our standard of living by 0.13% per year, what should we do? The most plausible economic answer is: nothing. Because the cure is worse than the disease and likely to hurt the economy by much more than&nbsp;that.";
