<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/6224>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“So let’s abandon fanciful and fleetingly ineffective climate policies. Let’s rapidly transition to the cleanest and most reliable electricity source we have (nuclear).&nbsp; […]&nbsp;“Let’s stop torturing ourselves with totalitarian policies against a virus we can’t&nbsp;control.”";
