<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/6191>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“The climate has always been changing and it will most likely always continue to change,” England claimed. “In the distant past, we have been much colder than we are now and we have been much warmer than we are now. And all of that happened many times without humans.";
