<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/6124>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“Anthony Watts has shown himself to be a sad, creepy, desperate man, who has nothing better to with his life than this. He apparently doesn’t understand the whole exercise was irrelevant from the start, since — as I have pointed out many times in the past — we have a plan in which all of our power comes from wind energy. As one Twitter commenter noted, we’ll probably finding him reduced to searching through people’s trash soon enough. The episode does nothing other than to demonstrate both the man’s lack of integrity and dullness of mind.”";
        schema:archivedAt        <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/6124/source/93>;
        schema:author            <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/entity/anthony-watts/>;
