<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/6005>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“Cold periods will come again. When they do, modern technology can mitigate the effects, if there is a very plentiful supply of extra energy. Unwarranted and unwise suppression of hydrocarbon energy and nuclear-electric energy that leaves humanity without plentiful energy when natural changes in climate occur is now a significant danger.”";
        schema:archivedAt        <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/6005/source/16>;
