<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/5964>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“No discussion about the need to reduce carbon emissions is complete without acknowledging the key role that natural gas has played and will continue to play going forward. America is leading the world in reducing carbon emissions largely because of clean natural gas. In fact, the U.S. Energy Information Administration estimates that natural gas is responsible for more CO2 emissions reductions in electricity generation than renewables.”";
