        schema:abstract          "“How would we—if we decided if we actually did know, which we don’t and don’t doubt we ever will—how much of an impact these hydrocarbons are having on the planet’s climate? Overwhelming whatever adaptive ability, which the planet has amazing adaptive abilities. Okay, well then what could we do? What should we do? What will we do? And the answers are pitiful.";
