        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“It’s important for everyone to know America First energy policy means prioritizing our country’s interests. That means we are removing unnecessary and burdensome regulations, punitive regulations, that have made energy less competitive on the world stage.” ";
