<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/5472>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“Like an economy, fields of scientific research undergo periods of boom and bust. The boom in climate science is driven by a confluence of factors: scientific uncertainty, political opportunism, ideological predispositions, a sustained push from the Intergovernmental Panel on Climate Change, and massive funding from various government&nbsp;entities.”";
        schema:archivedAt        <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/5472/source/>;
        schema:author            <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/entity/independent-institute/>;
