<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/5384>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“We aren’t going to put the carbon dioxide genie back in the bottle. There’s no going back. There is too much fossil fuel, it’s too cheap, and it’s too easy to get.”";
