        schema:abstract          "Naomi Seibt: [00:21:41] They [Liberals] portray us as the Nazis and they say that we will be the ones who promote dictatorships, which is absolutely ludicrous. We are the ones really fighting for freedom here. And the increase of taxes is a direct path to more socialism, of course, and more authoritarianism. But we have started to believe the government that they will protect us from harm. &nbsp;[00:22:13]";
        schema:archivedAt        <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/5302/source/73>;
