        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“[Naomi Seibt] was invited as a speaker to the New Year’s welcome event of the local branch of the far-right party ‘Alternative for Germany’&nbsp;in February 2020 [7]. Rüdiger Lucassen, one of the speakers at the event stated that ‘we are proud of the achievements of our mothers and fathers and not ashamed of them’. [8] Since Lucassen was born in 1951, his parents were part of the generation that enabled, supported and committed crimes during the reign of the Nazis in Germany.”";
