        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“It is caused by lots of different things, and you can’t say that climate change is only caused by humans,” Harbert said. “I think the science is what you’re pointing to, and we have a robust debate going on in this country, as we should, and those that would say everything is settled sort of undercut the integrity of science. It’s an ongoing discussion.”";
