<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/5154>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“The environmental organizations are going to be emboldened by this and going to go after more projects. On the industry side, they’re going to have to step it up. People are going to take [a] step back and reassess what went wrong and what they could have done differently. Anybody representing any energy or infrastructure project is going to have to take a look at the tactics. Do you politicize it more or try to take politics out of&nbsp;it?”";
