<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/5107>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“We have developed a program that we believe will not only maximize the value of your two days with us, but also your ability to effectively achieve what we believe to be your policy, political and philanthropic goals. Among other topics, in April, we’ll discuss how to more effectively engage growing demographic groups, such as Hispanic and Latino voters, and how to encourage principled and effective advocates of free enterprise to run for office.";
