        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“In a statement for this article Tara said, ‘I was very surprised and disappointed that after the charming and polite conversation I’d had earlier with Mr. Koch in the resort gym that he would have his representative treat me in such a thuggish and frightening manner.’”";
