<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/5080>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "We must stop this futile waste of community savings; cease the destruction and dislocation of human industry; stop killing rare bats and birds with wind turbine blades and solar/thermal sizzlers; stop pelletising trees to feed power stations designed to burn coal; stop converting food to motor vehicle fuel; and stop the clearing of bush and forests for biofuel cultivation and&nbsp;plantations.";
