<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/5064>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "We also showed that satellite measurements of heat exposure matched the aerial bleaching scores as well as the underwater scores. The south didn’t bleach in 2016 because it was cool, the north was the most severely bleached because it was hottest.”";
