<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/4965>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“Alex Epstein has helped me re-frame my thinking, as Julian Simon set out to do, to take into account all facets of the human environment when dealing with environmental issues. He illustrates very effectively that the ‘natural’ environment is not conducive to human progress, and thus we must set out to improve it if we wish to improve ourselves.”";
        schema:archivedAt        <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/4965/source/12>;
