<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/4857>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“This (environmental treaty) process has nothing to do with the weather. It has nothing to do with man’s impact on the weather. It has everything to do with establishing the socialist international at the heart of the UN and making every nation bow the knee to this new dictatorship, and the climate is merely a fig leaf to cover what they are trying to do.”";
        schema:archivedAt        <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/4857/source/22>;
