<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/4761>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“The architects of the private voucher movement realize something that all too many conservatives have inexplicably forgotten in the 1990s: America is a free country. You do not have to wait for the politicians to advance a conservative reform agenda. You can take leadership into your own hands. You can create the institutions that will reshape the political and cultural landscape: the politicians will respond.";
        schema:archivedAt        <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/4761/source/>;
