<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/4722>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“You might have the recipe for making the most perfect and delicious pizza, but if the chef is hubristic, or crazy, or incompetent, you are not going to end up with a particularly tasty pizza. Does that mean you shouldn’t eat pizza again? No, it just means you shouldn’t eat pizza cooked by that chef.”";
        schema:archivedAt        <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/4722/source/>;
        schema:author            <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/entity/institute-economic-affairs/>;
