<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/4712/source/61>
        rdf:type         schema:CreativeWork;
        schema:citation  "“<a href=\"http://web.archive.org/web/20191015122815/https://livefromlordnorthstreet.podbean.com/e/rebels-without-a-cause/\" data-wpel-link=\"external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"external noopener noreferrer\">Rebels without a cause?</a>” <em>Institute of Economic Affairs</em>, October 11, 2019. Archived October 15, 2019. Archive.fo URL:&nbsp;<a href=\"http://archive.fo/sKufO\" data-wpel-link=\"external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"external noopener noreferrer\">http://archive.fo/sKufO</a>"^^rdf:HTML .

