<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/4708>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“I also think there are whole government departments that can be closed down. The Department for Culture, Media and Sport? Culture, Media and Sport should belong to the people, not the state bureaucracy. The Department for Business, Innovation and Skills – surely, the three things governments are worst at. That department can be abolished&nbsp;overnight.”";
        schema:archivedAt        <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/4708/source/101>;
