<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/4672>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“[A]lthough CO2 levels in the atmosphere have continued rising, it has become clearer than ever that global temperatures are no longer following suit… . evidence for a human link to such warming as has occurred in recent decades was not just being seriously exaggerated but even deliberately manipulated, to produce findings which the data simply did not justify.”";
        schema:archivedAt        <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/4672/source/12>;
