<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/4614>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“We as country need to ask ourselves, and we need to answer: what is true environmentalist? Is it truly prohibition? Is it to say that though we’ve been blessed with certain natural resources we shouldn’t use them? Or should we use those natural resources to feed and power the world and do so with environmental stewardship in mind? And it’s a very important question,” Pruitt said. “";
        schema:archivedAt        <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/4614/source/30>;
        schema:author            <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/entity/brooke-rollins/>;
