        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“I think that’s a great question, and one that a lot smarter people than I have been thinking about for a long time, but I think that’s exactly right. … It is a very difficult mountain to climb when the entire public education system is against those sorts of teachings, which we know to be right.";
