<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/4463>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "Do you know how many young scientists’ and old scientists’ lives have been ruined because they wouldn’t go along with that? I would tell Donald Trump to reach out to them and bring the real scientists back into science and into medicine. So that America can see real science and real medical research again, not the Soviet-style science that has emerged under Barry Obama from Honolulu.”";
