        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“We do need a hub airport in the south-east of England… If you want to have a hub airport three runways probably isn’t enough. If we’re imaginative about Heathrow, I don’t see why we can’t build four runways&nbsp;there.”";
