<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/4382/source/19>
        rdf:type         schema:CreativeWork;
        schema:citation  "Dominic Penna. “<a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20240814230559/https://www.telegraph.co.uk/politics/2024/08/09/people-rioting-because-of-state-of-britain-not-southport/\" data-wpel-link=\"external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"external noopener noreferrer\">People are rioting over the state of Britain – not Southport, says Tory peer</a>,” <em>The Telegraph</em>, August 9, 2024. Archived August 14, 2024. Archive URL: <a href=\"https://archive.is/eNaKW\" data-wpel-link=\"external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"external noopener noreferrer\">https://archive.is/eNaKW</a>"^^rdf:HTML .

<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/4382>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“The Net Zero Scrutiny Group will continue. We had a number of peers in it before. I intend it to continue – and perhaps even stand it up with some external funding – if we can fund it as a proper group, to actually tell the story to new parliamentarians about why the current thinking is so woolly and so wrong and so costly, and there’s a better way of doing this.”";
        schema:archivedAt        <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/4382/source/19>;
