        schema:citation  "George Will. “<a href=\"http://www.washingtonpost.com/opinions/george-will-climate-changes-instructive-past/2015/01/07/2ae70ee6-95d2-11e4-aabd-d0b93ff613d5_story.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener external noreferrer\" data-wpel-link=\"external\">Climate change’s instructive past</a>,” <em>The Washington Post</em>, January 7, 2015."^^rdf:HTML .

<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/4376>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“We know, because they often say so, that those who think catastrophic global warming is probable and perhaps imminent are exemplary empiricists. They say those who disagree with them are ‘climate change deniers’ disrespectful of science.”";
