<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/4361>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“I don’t think there is a catastrophic climate change happening at all. It’s just cyclical. What we have observed now and all the warming we have observed, pretty much ending in the late nineties, so we’re now at a plateau, right, in terms of temperature. […] People are looking at natural explanations, that it will be becoming cooler from now on. The climate change that we have been observing, it’s ah… in terms of temperature change, it’s very, very small compared to what has been happening geologically,” Nikolov ";
