        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“While bringing electricity to many remote villages in India and the Sahara causes an increase in carbon emissions, it also allows families to have refrigeration for their food, electricity to light their homes and the time to develop their lives beyond working just to sustain themselves every day. &nbsp; ‘Don’t they deserve the same kinds of life changing benefits that power has brought the west?’ Norberg asks.”";
