<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/4334>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“There is no doubt that atmospheric greenhouse gases are rising rapidly and little doubt that some warming and bad ecological events are occurring. However, the main basis of the claim that man’s release of greenhouse gases is the cause of the warming is based almost entirely upon climate models. We all know the frailty of models concerning the air-surface system.";
        schema:archivedAt        <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/4334/source/>;
