        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“The supposed savings [in green energy] are calculated against the cost of continuing to be straight-jacketed by draconian climate change targets, but without investing any new resources in flexibility measures. […] Any illusory savings from flexibility measures will be dwarfed by the cost of renewable&nbsp;subsidies.”";
