        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“That global warming can be somehow ‘irreversible’ is pure propaganda; the climate has always been changing and it always will. […]&nbsp;A temperature rise of more than two degrees is not inherently dangerous either,” Wilkinson&nbsp;claimed.";
