        schema:citation  "“AMERICAN TRADITION INSTITUTE, et al., Plaintiffs, v. THE STATE OF COLORADO, et al., Defendants” (<a href=\"http://www.americantradition.org/wp-content/uploads/2011/04/ATI-RPS-Lawsuit-Tanton-Declaration.pdf\" data-wpel-link=\"external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"external noopener noreferrer\">PDF</a>). UNITED STATES DISTRICT COURT FOR THE DISTRICT OF COLORADO, Statement of Thomas Tanton. Republished by the American Tradition Institute."^^rdf:HTML .

