        rdf:type         schema:CreativeWork;
        schema:citation  "Douglas Carswell. “<a href=\"https://conservativehome.blogs.com/centreright/2008/01/eco-sceptic.html\" data-wpel-link=\"external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"external noopener noreferrer\">Eco-sceptic?</a>” <em>ConservativeHome,</em> January 21, 2008. <a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20210104113441/https://conservativehome.blogs.com/centreright/2008/01/eco-sceptic.html\" data-wpel-link=\"external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"external noopener noreferrer\">Archived January 4, 2021</a>. Archive.vn URL: <a href=\"https://archive.vn/WChKh\" data-wpel-link=\"external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"external noopener noreferrer\">https://archive.vn/WChKh</a>"^^rdf:HTML .

<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/4253>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“Having joined Friends of the Earth years before I ever joined the Conservatives, I have always been adamant about the need to conserve the environment. Yet, after reading this book, I wonder if global warming is really man-made. According to Singer and Avery, the climate is in constant flux – and the change has little to do with us.”";
