<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/4246>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“It’s not Gazprom’s job to make life easier for feckless, climate-posing British politicians but to maximize the selling price it obtains for its natural gas. If high energy prices force energy-intensive industries to close and inflict a miserable winter and a savage cost of living crisis on poorer Britons, that’s their problem, not Gazprom’s.”";
        schema:archivedAt        <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/4246/source/>;
        schema:author            <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/entity/rupert-darwall/>;
