<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/4225>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“Important things not clear from the clip Bolt shared are either John Coleman’s actual link to the Weather Channel or his actual qualifications, “Readfearn notes. The full clip, which Bolt does not publish, goes on to an interview with Weather Channel CEO David Kenny who point out that Coleman “has not been with the Weather Channel for 31 years.” Kenny added, “ “I would prefer people to use their credentials they have today, not the credentials of three decades ago.”";
        schema:archivedAt        <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/4225/source/27>;
