<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/4127>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“Carbon math makes clear that without major effort and a good bit of luck, &nbsp;we are unlikely to control the growth of emissions enough to meet the standards that many climate scientists suggest are necessary. It is time to end the delusions and start thinking realistically about what can and will be done,” Lazear writes.";
