<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/4095>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“Our industry is prepared to invest billions in LNG export terminals, each of which represent a multimillion dollar investment in infrastructure, as well as longterm investments in U.S. labor and materials. Yet, over 20 applications for export permits remain on hold at the Department of Energy (DOE),” Gerard lamented.";
