        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“First, this bill slashes funding for Earth Science by half a billion dollars in FY 19—a quarter of the total Earth Science budget. These cuts are simply another manifestation of the Majority’s continued war on climate science,” Johnson said in his statement.";
