<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/4016>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“They reveal celebrated climate scientists apparently conspiring to corrupt the peer-review process, to suppress or finesse temperature data at odds with global-warming alarmism, to silence or discredit climate experts who criticize their work, and to hide or eliminate the raw data on which their own much-trumpeted claims have been based,” he wrote.";
