<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/3936>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“Next week we’re going to have a hearing on our favorite subject of climate change and also on the scientific method, which has been repeatedly ignored by the so-called self-professed climate scientists,” Smith told the audience.";
