        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“At the end of this Congress, I will have completed my six-year term as chairman of the Science, Space and Technology Committee,” he wrote in an email. “I have one new grandchild and a second arriving soon! And I hope to find other ways to stay involved in politics.”";
