<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/3886>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "However, obtaining all of the data and methods used in this study seemingly was not enough for the Majority. You also demanded internal communications by NOAA scientists regarding their scientific research. NOAA, rightfully, has been reluctant to waste their time and resources, not to mention break confidence with their superb research scientists by responding to this demand.";
        schema:archivedAt        <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/3886/source/132>;
