<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/3885>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“It is important to note what is and what is not contained in this history of requests and responses. Your requests repeatedly asked for data and methodologies used in the study, and also requested that this information be made publically available. NOAA, through its two response letters, pointed the Committee to publically accessible locations where all of the underlying data and methodologies can be accessed. Moreover, NOAA attempted to explain certain aspects of the methodology about which the Majority was apparently confused.";
        schema:archivedAt        <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/3885/source/132>;
