<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/3871>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“The science is clear and overwhelming but not in the way the president says. For example, statements by President Obama and others continually attempt to link extreme weather events to climate change. These claims are, of course, unfounded. […] The fact is there is little evidence that climate change causes extreme weather events.”";
        schema:archivedAt        <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/3871/source/24>;
