        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“President Trump also pulled America out of the hopelessly ineffective Paris Climate Agreement. Even as other countries in the world cling to the Paris Agreement’s false hopes, the United States under the leadership of President Trump has called it for what it is: a bad deal.”";
