        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“Climate alarmists […] reject critiques and say science is settled. They predict climate disasters without any hard evidence. And they ignore or cherry pick data to get their desired results. These violations of the scientific method are found repeatedly in the alarmist arguments.";
