        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“I’ve been with them now for about well, a little over a year,” Wojick said. “[…] We’re focusing initially on climate change, because that’s Pat’s area of expertise, but we’re also trying to branch out into other areas, science-intensive policy areas, and really science as a whole.”";
