<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/3821>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“So basically, the alarmists have created a problem for themselves. They first made the models “hot,” which means highly sensitive to CO2, in order to hype the scare. Now they have made the warming-limit target impossibly low for political correctness (and revenue enhancement).";
        schema:archivedAt        <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/3821/source/>;
