<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/3748>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "Repeatedly exposing the blatant lies and errors in Green propaganda achieves next to nothing. They don't give a stuff. 'Climate' is an existential war, waged by our parasitic, power-crazed Blob establishment, on individual freedom, on tax-payers &amp; ordinary people in general.";
