<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/3742>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "The 'Climate Industry' is a terrible misnomer. These parasites are not in the least industrious, and they are anti-industry. These half-witted misanthropes &amp; nihilists are anti-growth, anti-progress, anti-people, and are hell-bent on destroying Western manufacturing.";
        schema:archivedAt        <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/3742/source/>;
        schema:author            <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/entity/martin-durkin/>;
