        schema:citation  "Kyla Mandel. “<a href=\"//www.desmog.com/2014/11/30/mcintyre-mission-obsessive-quest-disprove-michael-mann-hockey-stick\" data-wpel-link=\"external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"external noopener noreferrer\">McIntyre’s Mission: An Obsessive Quest to Disprove Michael Mann’s Hockey</a>,” <em>Desmog</em>, November 30, 2014."^^rdf:HTML .

