        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“The bottom line is, we’ve won. We’ve actually won. You don’t hear that because the national media doesn’t like the idea,” Inhofe said to the audience, pointing to changes in polls from 2002 when global warming was the number one issue in America, to now as number fifteen.&nbsp;&nbsp;“The people have caught on. They know that the science is not definite, hasn’t been decided yet.”";
