        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“The final rule is still illegal and will be changed in court as soon as the ink is dry later this summer,” Domenech says. “The cost of the rule is in the billions. The final rule still imposes higher energy prices on families, businesses, and the poor,” he adds.";
        schema:archivedAt        <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/3456/source/76>;
