<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/3427>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“When people say things about our business,” WFA’s CEO and General Manager Frederick D. Palmer said, “and our effect on people in a public forum, in a New York Times’ ad, the Internet or national television, by God, they better be ready to back up what they say.";
