        schema:citation  "Paul C. “Chip” Knappenberger and Patrick J. Michaels. “<a href=\"http://web.archive.org/web/20160728030814/http://www.cato.org/blog/co2-400ppm-growing\" data-wpel-link=\"external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"external noopener noreferrer\">CO2: 400ppm and Growing</a>,” Cato Institute, May 14, 2013. Archived July 28, 2016. Archive.is URL: <a href=\"https://archive.is/yGSBh\" data-wpel-link=\"external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"external noopener noreferrer\">https://archive.is/yGSBh</a>"^^rdf:HTML .

