        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“The atmospheric concentration of carbon dioxide (CO2) has recently reached a ‘milestone’ of 400 parts per million (ppm). In some circles, this announcement has been met with consternation and gnashing of teeth. The proper reaction is celebration.”";
