        schema:citation  "Patrick J. Michaels and Paul C. “Chip” Knappenberger. <a href=\"http://web.archive.org/web/20160728031340/http://object.cato.org/sites/cato.org/files/pubs/pdf/working-paper-35_2.pdf\" data-wpel-link=\"external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"external noopener noreferrer\">“Climate Models and Climate Reality: A Closer Look at a Lukewarming World” (PDF)</a>, Cato Institute, December 15, 2015. Archived .pdf on file at Desmog."^^rdf:HTML .

