        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "‘Our position is it’s a very serious issue, that we have an industrial contribution to greenhouse gas emissions and we’re part of the solution,’ said Erik Milito, a vice president at the American Petroleum Institute, an industry trade group. ‘There’s no denial.’”";
