<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/3262/source/25>
        rdf:type         schema:CreativeWork;
        schema:citation  "Juliet Eilperin. “<a href=\"https://www.washingtonpost.com/climate-environment/when-it-comes-to-acknowledging-humans-role-in-climate-change-oil-and-gas-industry-lawyer-says-that-ship-has-sailed/2019/09/26/63c0d250-c9c2-11e9-a4f3-c081a126de70_story.html\" data-wpel-link=\"external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"external noopener noreferrer\">When it comes to acknowledging humans’ role in climate change, oil and gas industry lawyer says ‘that ship has sailed,’</a>” <em>The Washington Post</em>, September 26, 2019. <a href=\"http://web.archive.org/web/20191011171832/https://www.washingtonpost.com/climate-environment/when-it-comes-to-acknowledging-humans-role-in-climate-change-oil-and-gas-industry-lawyer-says-that-ship-has-sailed/2019/09/26/63c0d250-c9c2-11e9-a4f3-c081a126de70_story.html\" data-wpel-link=\"external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"external noopener noreferrer\">Archived October 11, 2019</a>. Archive.fo URL: <a href=\"https://archive.fo/3Ty1A\" data-wpel-link=\"external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"external noopener noreferrer\">https://archive.fo/3Ty1A</a>"^^rdf:HTML .

<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/3262>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“’It doesn’t matter whether it’s real, or not real, or what the issues are,’ said Barron, who heads the energy litigation arm of Baker Hostetler. ‘That ship has sailed from a political perspective.’ Barron also said young Americans under 40 have grown up learning climate change is ‘an existential crisis that we need to address.’";
