<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/3228>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“[F]or those who have lamented our use of plastic packaging over the years, it’s understandable, especially since the marketers sometimes make excessive use of the stuff. But the coronavirus shows that public hygiene was, and remains, an important priority, and we downplay it at our peril,” he&nbsp;concluded.";
        schema:archivedAt        <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/3228/source/43>;
        schema:author            <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/entity/fraser-institute/>;
