        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“[D]espite steady increases in atmospheric CO2, and despite everything you’ve heard about climate catastrophe, there’s been no warming for about the last decade, and the planet has actually cooled over the last three years. […] That should lead us to ask ";
