        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“There are also questions about the data used for global warming models. Much of the original temperature data used to justify claims of unprecedented warming has been destroyed or lost. Additionally, some scientists believe that changes in the environment surrounding weather stations may have contributed to perceived&nbsp;warming.”";
