        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“Inconvenient Youth members should be aware that many scientists believe that the climate was warmer during medieval times than it is today. They should ask themselves, if this is true, doesn’t it suggest that the modern warming trend may be natural, not caused by&nbsp;man?";
