<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/3107>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“Kids need to hear the other side of the story so that they can better target their energies, including their environmental passions. Teenagers should know that skeptics aren’t just an evil fringe in the pocket of the oil industry. Many legitimate questions remain about climate change, its causes, and potential&nbsp;solutions.";
