<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/3075>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“[Wilcke] is an advocate of what economists call ‘laissez faire’&nbsp;capitalism – the type of economy urged in the 18th century by Scottish economist Adam Smith or in this century by economists of the Austrian school (Friedrich von Hayek and Ludwig von Mises) or the Chicago school (Milton&nbsp;Friedman).";
        schema:archivedAt        <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/3075/source/>;
