<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/3058/source/12>
        rdf:type         schema:CreativeWork;
        schema:citation  "“<a href=\"http://web.archive.org/web/20191029025810/http://climaterealists.com/?id=2062\" data-wpel-link=\"external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"external noopener noreferrer\">Video: Climate Change. Interview with Hans Labohm</a>,” <em>Climate Realists, </em>November 8, 2008. Full video archived at DeSmog."^^rdf:HTML .

<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/3058>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "Hans Labohm: “Well, I think that the complete freeze on CO2 emissions will be the end of our civilization as we know it, because our way of life is critically dependent upon the availability of energy at affordable prices. And there are billions of people out there who also want to attain a better standard of living.";
