        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "” […] the point is that people have been indoctrinated by the one-sided, uh, announcement and statements of the IPCC and this particular fact that they don’t have no detectable effect on temperatures. Has always been hidden by the IPCC and by the proponents of the manmade global warming hypothesis.”";
