        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“If natural forces have played a significant role in the moderate and unsteady temperature increases of the past 60 years, then what’s the climate hysteria about? If there is no need for hysteria, there is no need for the Paris climate agreement,” he concluded.";
