<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/2909>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“We think that, at least from the Trump administration’s perspective, and I agree with this, this is my personal perspective as well, is that climate is certainly a challenge and is a major problem that we need to work together to address. But there are other big issues out there that I would certainly argue are much more challenging, much more immediate,” Banks said.";
