<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/2827>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "RAZ: Now, your research, Dr. Latif, has been cited by climate change skeptics here in the U.S., by for example, George Will, a conservative columnist with the Washington Post, to show that the Earth actually goes through natural warming and cooling trends and that climate change is really being overhyped. Do you think your work is being misused?";
        schema:archivedAt        <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/2827/source/>;
        schema:author            <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/entity/mojib-latif/>;
