<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/2819>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“Global warming may be real, but there’s hardly a shred of good scientific evidence that it has very much to do with the amount of CO2 we’re producing, or even that temperatures have risen as much as warmists say.”";
