        schema:citation  "Brendan Montague. “<a href=\"//www.desmog.com/2015/11/27/madness-viscount-monckton-descends-paris-conference\" data-wpel-link=\"external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"external noopener noreferrer\">Obama’s Secret Plot to Launch Communist World State at Paris Climate Conference*</a>” DeSmog, December 3, 2015."^^rdf:HTML .

<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/2795>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "With reference to the COP21 climate conference, “They are trying to establish a single world government,” Monckston said. “You can argue whether it is communist or fascist depending on whether you think the people concerned are crony capitalists, in which case it’s fascist, or whether they are collectivists, in which case it’s communist.”";
        schema:archivedAt        <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/2795/source/36>;
        schema:author            <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/entity/science-and-public-policy-institute/>;
