<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/2778>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“Furthermore, contrary to the blatantly false contention of the United States Environmental Protection Agency and others, CO2 is not a pollutant; it is a pollution fighter that reduces the negative effects of true pollutants, such as ozone, and replaces them with positive effects that are of great worth to man and nature alike.” — Joint ";
        schema:archivedAt        <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/2778/source/8>;
        schema:author            <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/entity/science-and-public-policy-institute/>;
