<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/2741>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "CCC seems to break many rules. Foreign citizen Lomborg is simultaneously CCC founder, president, and highest-paid employee. Most people are a little more subtle when trying to create conduits, as in this example, where the IRS determined someone was not eligible for 501(c)(3) status, despite various stratagems to obscure the relationships.”";
        schema:archivedAt        <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/2741/source/>;
        schema:author            <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/entity/copenhagen-consensus-center/>;
