        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“Population control has been a long-expressed desire of radical environmentalists, who have completely bought in to the Malthusian conceit, both original and neo. Since the 1940s, they’ve been issuing Henny Penny warnings of the Great Human Die-Off,” Benson wrote.";
