        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“Surely the Catholic leaders really do care about ‘the poorest and most vulnerable. If they do, rather than calling for the unrealistic ‘end of the fossil fuel era,’ they’d call for the ‘climate aid’ to be spent on ‘improved public health, education and economic development,’ as recommended by noted economist Bjørn Lomborg.”";
