<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/2685>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "Noon writes: “The bishops want to protect the poor from climate risks, but the risks from poverty are much greater and more immediate than those from climate change, and the global treaty the bishops want would slow, stop, or reverse economic growth, destroy jobs, and raise energy costs, harming everyone–especially the poor and elderly.”";
