<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/2684>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“We can say this for environmental activists– they are persistent, constantly developing collectivist schemes to increase the size and scope of government. And they are becoming more ambitious. Not content with giving more power to Uncle Sam, they now seek to give greater power to the United Nations, a move that would seriously undermine American sovereignty and pave the way for top-down global wealth transfer schemes that would make the Great Society look small.”";
        schema:archivedAt        <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/2684/source/7>;
