        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“Have you ever thought for a second, what is the evidence upon which we are asked to sacrifice so much in terms of the economy? What is the evidence because of which we think global warming is such a bad problem that we’re going to heat our planet into a catastrophic, um, catastrophe? What is the evidence? And the answer is there is no evidence that the situation is like that,” Shaviv said.";
