<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/2403>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "We will also be presenting examples of real-world evidence contradicting important U.N. climate claims. We will be delivering the truth that the only thing ‘settled’ about the global warming debate is that U.N. climate reports have little credibility. Skeptics present a far better scientific case.”";
