<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/2345>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“If the science is bogus and the economics don’t work, sooner or later policy makers will be forced to develop an exit strategy from their doom-and-gloom scenarios. I don’t see how they can reach any of their objectives at the upcoming UN climate conference in Copenhagen.”";
