<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/2266>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“Meanwhile, the theory of man-made global warming is a myth. For example, the worldwide average temperature has not risen in the last 18 years. So the theorists changed the name to “climate change.” Well, to borrow a line from Marco Rubio, there’s always climate change—it’s called ‘the&nbsp;weather.’”";
