<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/2245>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“If you dig into the data, there’s absolutely no climate crisis, and the weather’s not getting worse, and CO2 isn’t the climate control knob,” Nelson said. “Just about everything that they’re telling you is a lie. And anything alarming they’re telling you, everything is a lie. There’s nothing alarming at all happening with the weather or the climate.”";
