        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“Second, the greenhouse gases alluded to are real but are mostly the result of volcanoes, hurricanes and underwater geologic displacements. Regrettably, none of these causes can be corralled by environmentalists hungry for regulation and taxes and, therefore, must be ignored.&nbsp;&nbsp;";
        schema:archivedAt        <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/2206/source/40>;
