<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/2109>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“Nothing could be further from the truth,” Tillerson said. “They’re dealing with a period of time that happened decades ago,” he said. “I’m not sure how helpful it would be for me to talk about it, particularly as we’re leading up to some very important meetings that are going to occur in Paris here in just a few weeks. I don’t want to be a distraction. I really don’t want this to be a distraction. There’s some serious issues that need to be talked about.”";
