<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/2081/source/3>
        rdf:type         schema:CreativeWork;
        schema:citation  "Nils-Axel Morner. “<a href=\"//www.desmog.com/wp-content/uploads/files/Paper%20619a.%20Paris-1.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener external noreferrer\" data-wpel-link=\"external\">When Science becomes disgraced, it’s time for a new Independent Committee on Geoethics</a>,” Retrieved from ResearchGate.net. PDF archived at&nbsp;Desmog."^^rdf:HTML .

<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/2081>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“The idea of a CO2-driven Global Warming has escalated ‘in absurdum’&nbsp;become a religion and turned into an AGW monster (disgracing Science and Geoethics),” Mörner said.&nbsp;The purpose of the ICG is to counteract this “disgrace” of science. “CO2-driven (anthropogenic) Global Warming has become a religion and spread around the globe like a plague or revival movement,” Mörner adds.&nbsp;[…] “what we now need is a total REFORMATION back to Science and away from “Anti-science.”";
        schema:archivedAt        <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/2081/source/3>;
        schema:author            <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/entity/independent-committee-geoethics/>;
