        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“’Climate change is real,’ they say. So what? Gravity and sunrise are also real. That doesn’t mean we cause them or we would be better off without them. Climate has been changing since the origin of the atmosphere billions of years ago,” Ball and Harriss write.";
