<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/1939>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "Neguse: “According to the NAACP air task force report, African American communities face an elevated risk of cancer due to air toxic emissions from natural gas development. And over 1 million African Americans live in counties that face a cancer risk above the EPA’s level of concern from toxics emitted by natural gas facilities. So I’m curious how you would respond to that statistic. “";
