<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/1848>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "What you have to understand is given these huge cycles that we’ve had over the last even 10,000 years, this global warming stuff is, you know, doesn’t matter very much relative to the other forces that we don’t understand them. You could spend&nbsp;fortunes in time wasting your efforts stopping things that may never&nbsp;occur.";
        schema:archivedAt        <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/1848/source/>;
