        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“Spencer and Christy each authored five papers captured in our climate science literature survey. Among those papers, we classified one of Spencer’s and two of Christy’s as minimizing or rejecting the human influence on global warming, and the others as not taking a position on the issue.&nbsp;&nbsp;";
