<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/1806>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“The American Meteorological Society did their survey and they specifically asked the question, Is man the dominate controller of climate over the last 50 years? Only 52 percent said yes. That is not a consensus at all in science … Roy and I have both made the statement that we are in the 97 percent because we believe in some (man-made) effect.”";
        schema:archivedAt        <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/1806/source/54>;
