<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/1753>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "We know the World Economic Forum is on the same heels they’re using the COVID lockdowns and COVID fears the same way they’ve used climate fears. They’re actually calling for a Great Reset. This is what the World Economic Forum John Kerry has called for. The Great Reset. Al Gore. And the idea is we are going to hammer the economy down, break it apart, and then rebuild it in this green image. So they’re very excited. It’s a merging, if you will, of the COVID solutions with the climate solutions. And you know, that’s what John Kerry said. The parallels are screaming at us. ";
        schema:archivedAt        <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/1753/source/>;
        schema:author            <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/entity/one-america-news-network-oann/>;
        schema:claimInterpreter  <http://desmog.com/>;
        schema:inLanguage        "English"^^schema:Text;
        schema:publisher         <http://desmog.com/>;
        schema:url               "https://www.desmog.com/one-america-news-network-oann/" .

