<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/1733>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“The Governor blames global warming, but you know, a lot of the problems we have or we can fix,” Dahle commented. “There’s three things you have to have to have a wildfire, you have to have ignition, oxygen and fuel. The one thing we can contain is fuel. We can thin our forests that are overgrown because of the bad policies out of this administration and many other administrations here in California.”";
        schema:archivedAt        <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/1733/source/37>;
