        schema:citation  "Roger Koops. “<a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20231004215330/https://brownstone.org/articles/rise-and-rhetoric-of-climate-chicken-littles/\" data-wpel-link=\"external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"external noopener noreferrer\">The Rise and Rhetoric of the Climate Chicken Littles</a>,” <em>Brownstone Institute</em>, August 4, 2023. Archived October 4, 2023. Archive URL: <a href=\"https://archive.ph/CX9lx\" data-wpel-link=\"external\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"external noopener noreferrer\">https://archive.ph/CX9lx</a>"^^rdf:HTML .

