<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/1354>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "And that’s fascinating to me. That’s the the two different models of primitivism: Two groups that most hate the modern Western world and want to destroy it, and have competing models of primitivism. And the soft, delusional utopian primitivism of Western environmentalists when it came up against the hard, serious face of hardcore Islamic primitivism—Earth Hour in Sweden—the hardcore guys, their primitivism model won out. Because they mean it. And these soft, sappy, deluded, middle aged Western students don’t.”";
        schema:archivedAt        <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/1354/source/14>;
        schema:author            <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/entity/mark-steyn/>;
