        schema:abstract          "“Essentially we have two competing views of primitivism fighting for supremacy in our world. Both of them hate the Western developed world. The environmental crowd think it’s a great evil. So do the Sharia crowd. And once every so often these conflicting models of primitivism interact.";
        schema:archivedAt        <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/1352/source/>;
