<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/1317>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "Consumer confidence and financial spending power are not the only threat to businesses small and large—the fear of being hit with lawsuits by employees and customers who may come down with the virus also exists. This fear is well justified: hundreds of lawsuits have already been filed with mass-litigation firms working furiously to recruit clients for additional suits and potential class action litigation.";
        schema:archivedAt        <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/1317/source/21>;
