<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/1287>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“In a spirited defence of his integrity, Tim Flannery (Insight, 8/10) repeats his misunderstanding of how the climate system works: Greenhouse gases emit more radiation than they absorb and their direct impact is to cool the atmosphere. More greenhouse gases will not cause the atmosphere to warm, as Flannery states in his book.”";
