        schema:abstract          "“The earth’s climate has always changed, is changing now, and will never cease changing. The extent to which man is responsible for climate change is not known, only surmised. There is no earthly force capable of stopping climate change.";
        schema:archivedAt        <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/1250/source/36>;
