<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/1235>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“Now you might think it insane to accord special preference to people because they express enthusiasm for and participation in non-procreative sexual practices. You might say that a civilization that takes ‘pride’ in such extreme self-indulgences is effeminate and courting death. And you would be right.";
        schema:archivedAt        <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/1235/source/>;
