<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/1169>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“If anybody ever says that government isn’t driving the rush to renewables or natural gas, then you’re absolutely wrong, because it’s the subsidies for wind and solar, it’s the mandates for wind and solar, and then it’s also the government guaranteeing these utility companies a guaranteed profit on shutting down old depreciated assets and then building new crap.”";
        schema:archivedAt        <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/1169/source/33>;
