<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/1125>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“The focusing on global warming as the reason for any hurricane (or making it more likely to occur or become more intense) ignores that natural variations are not only more important than indicated by the AP news story, but also that the human influence involves a diverse range of first-order climate forcings, including, but not limited global warming [which, of course, has not occurred since at least mid-2004!].”";
        schema:archivedAt        <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/1125/source/41>;
