<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/1083>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "Marlo Lewis: “I do believe there is global warming, although global warming has slowed down over the last decade, which I think is interesting because none of the climate models used by the Intergovernmental Panel on Climate Change to forecast global warming over the 21st century anticipated a roughly 10 year period with no net global warming. Which suggest that those models may be too sensitive or too hot.”";
        schema:archivedAt        <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/1083/source/>;
        schema:author            <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/entity/marlo-lewis-jr/>;
