<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/1030>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“Schnare threatens and is attempting to saddle Free Market with further financial consequences of his behavior, in furtherance of his express threats to drain Free Market’s assets if interested parties did not agree to his demands,” the court filing reads. “Schnare’s multiple errors and mistakes, to which he has admitted, have caused Free Market irreparable harm in that it may no longer fulfill its mission and must be dissolved as a result. Schnare’s continuing behavior is causing Free Market further and continuing repetitional and financial harms and is placing the organization at risk.”";
        schema:archivedAt        <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/1030/source/26>;
        schema:author            <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/entity/free-market-environmental-law-clinic/>;
