<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/993>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“Climate alarmists latch onto every climate catastrophe as evidence that mankind is destroying the planet. Even the recent NSW bushfires were attributed to previous emissions of carbon dioxide, with dark mutterings that Tony Abbott would exacerbate matters, in spite of the fact that the most recent IPCC report had been forced to acknowledge that there had been no increases in temperatures or extreme events over&nbsp;the past 10-15 years.";
        schema:archivedAt        <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/993/source/21>;
