        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“With respect to existing webpages referring to climate change, the draft proposes to recall/revoke all of them unless the web pages relate to scientific investigations undertaken by or at the office that maintains the web page(s) and it is clear to the reader what precisely is meant by the term ‘climate change’ and context is provided with respect to climate history, its importance relative to other factors affecting resources etc.” Goklany wrote.";
