        schema:abstract          "“This is […] a U.N.-backed body that quite frankly is an advocacy group for controls on carbon emissions,” said Harris. There’re over 10,000 reports that come out in any year on climate change […] and this group doesn’t represent at all that many of the leading scientists in the field. Our own scientists have raised questions about the data they’ve seen from the IPCC.”";
