        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“President Trump this week kept a campaign promise, one especially important to the West, ordering the EPA to withdraw its controversial ‘Waters of the United States’ (WOTUS) regulation. It is a welcome decision, though a great deal of work must be done now,” Walcher wrote.";
