        schema:abstract          "“Climate change is not a 2050 issue, it’s not a 2030 issue, it’s happening today. In fact it’s been measurably happening over the last 40 years,” Dickon Pinner, leader of McKinsey’s Sustainability Practice, said in a session at the 2019 ";
