<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/688>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“The GCC believes that the preponderance of the evidence indicates that most, if not all, of the observed warming is part of a natural warming trend which began approximately 400 years ago. If there is an anthropogenic component to this observed warming, the GCC believes that it must be very small and must be superimposed on a much larger natural warming trend.”";
