        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "According to Rahn, “The good news is that mankind will probably adapt to climate change just fine, as we have been adapting since the end of the Ice Age. New studies show that to date, the benefits of global warming have been greater than the costs, and are likely to remain so for many more decades.”";
