<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/664>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“We all know that climate change is a challenge for us all, wherever we live in the world. But we know that we can and should solve it by using free trade and investment to accelerate the technological progress that will protect the planet. And something that not enough politicians say, we must do this, we must protect the planet in a way that does not impoverish the UK, the US or let’s be honest any other country,” she said.";
