<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/631>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“The Trump administration rightly scaled back an Obama-era CAFE scheme that relied on models that don’t even rise to the level of witchcraft. The result will be more and safer choices for consumers at a better price per vehicle.”";
