<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/539>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“It’s extraordinary that anyone should think there is a climate crisis. Year after year our annual assessment of climate trends document just how little has been changing in the last 30 years. The habitual climate alarmism is mainly driven by scientists’ computer modelling, rather than observational evidence.”";
