<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/527>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "The company’s filings reveal funding for a range of organisations which have fought Barack Obama’s plans to cut greenhouse gas emissions, and denied the very existence of climate change.&nbsp;[…]";
