<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/382>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“We should recognise that it’s often working people in traditional industries who are expected to pay the price. Climate change affects us all, but this is a hard message to land with someone who has lost their job. It is also true that many of the measures proposed by more wealthy environmental activists would result in rising costs for working families.”";
