        schema:abstract          "Kupiec predicts “environmentally sustainable financial policies will experience a similar cycle of failure and revision” to efforts to maintain monetary stability. He concludes: “will the NGFS successfully create a new form of ‘transitional risk’ linked to climate-change fanaticism? Time will tell.”";
        schema:archivedAt        <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/378/source/>;
        schema:author            <http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/entity/american-enterprise-institute/>;
