<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/265>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“I am not a climatologist, but I don’t think any of the other witnesses are either. I do work in the related field of atomic, molecular and optical physics. I have spent my professional life studying the interactions of visible and infrared radiation with gases – one of the main physical phenomena behind the greenhouse effect. I have published over 200 papers in peer reviewed scientific journals.”";
