        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“Economic growth is the best way to continue to reduce poverty. However the Stern Report recommends we decrease growth,” the Centre’s publication claims. “The Stern strategy would reverse the current trends to eliminate poverty. It would increase the number of people in poor countries in absolute poverty.”";
