<http://data.open.ac.uk/climate-sense/claim/42>
        rdf:type                 schema:Claim;
        schema:abstract          "“i am sorry to see that you are not interested to learn if the sea levels are accelerating or not, but only to deviate from the only issue of interest. i do not play politics and i write in my papers what i see without caring too much of political agendas. sorry can’t presently support any sea level accelerating statement.”";
